<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="1CO" style="id">1WAKO - Kami Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">Wakolinto</para>
  <para style="toc1">Usenga wa Mulungu kama vuuwandikigwe na Wakolinto</para>
  <para style="toc2">1 Wakolinto</para>
  <para style="toc3">1Wako</para>
  <para style="mt2">Usenga wa Mulungu kama vuuwandikigwe na</para>
  <para style="mt1">Wakolinto</para>
  <para style="imt">Ulongozi</para>
  <para style="ip">Balua ino ya 1 Wakolinto yaandikigwa na Msenga Paulo hagati ya milao hamsini na tano kulawa viyavumbuke Kilisito 1:1. Ino iyo balua ya mosi kati ya balua mbili chili nazo ziyandikile Pulo mdibumbila da wamtogole Kilisito weli Kolinto. Paulo yodahika kandika balua ino chipindi viyakalile Efeso baho kakala yang'hali hanagesa kutembelela Kolinto viyakalile muumwanza wake kulawa Makedonia 16:5-9. Paulo kandika balua ino kuwedika kwa gaja gayahulike kulawa kwa wajalusona wamwenga wa mdibumbila da wamtogole Kilisito kwa mbuli za chakachaka zigendelela mdimbula da wamtogole Kilisito, gano ni hamwe na kuigola na mbuli za luhadu. Wanhu wa Kolinto ukala womanyika goya ng'hani kwa mbuli za luhadu ivo sio chinhu cha kusinhuka kua bumbila da wamtogole Kilisito kuiting'hana na mbuli izo. 1 Kolinto ivija imema sula imanyika ng'hani kwa mbuli ya wende 13.</para>
  <para style="iot">Galiumo</para>
  <para style="io">Paulo kosonga kwa kawalamusa Wakolinto na kumwing'ha hewela Mulungu kwa mbuli yao. Muisula 1:1-9.</para>
  <para style="io">Labaho kazilongelela mbuli zija ziyabokele kwambuli ya kuigola mdibumbila da wamtogole Mulungu weli Kolinto Misula 1:10-4-21.</para>
  <para style="io">Amala kalongelela mbuli za luhadu na kuigala munhu na miage mchitala Muisula 5-6.</para>
  <para style="io">Viyakomeleze gago, kalava malagizo kwa mbuli ya zengele na nhosa kwa milungu ya nyang'iti na kufugama kwa hamwe na nhunza za ki Mulungu zilawa kwa Mulungu na uzilibuko. Muisula 7-15.</para>
  <para style="io">Haichikomelezo kakomeleza kwa kulonga mbuli za sang'hano na zija mbuli zayeka za munhu. Muisula 16.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="1CO 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 1:1" />Niye Paulo ija nikemigwe na Mulungu kama viyalondile niwe msenga wa Kilisito Yesu, hano na hamwe na Sositenesi ija mtogola Kilisito mietu.<verse eid="1CO 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 1:2" />Nowandikila mweye bumbila da wamtogola Kilisito mli uko Kolinto, mweye muilumbile hamwe na Kilisito Yesu na kuwakema kua wanhu wake, mkemigwa kua wanhu wa Mulungu, hamwe na wanhu wose hohose womfugamila Mndewa Yesu Kilisito yeli Mndewa wao na Mndewa wetu.<verse eid="1CO 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 1:3" />Nowapulileni unovu wa Mulungu na utindiwala kulawa Mulungu Tata yetu na Mndewa wetu Yesu Kilisito ukale na mweye mose.<verse eid="1CO 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paulo komwing'ha hewela Mulungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 1:4" />Mazua gose nomwing'ha hewela Mulungu wangu kwa mbuli yenu kwa unovu yoweng'hani mweye kubitila Yesu Kilisito. <verse eid="1CO 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 1:5" />Kwa kuilumba na Kilisito mwing'higwa chila chinhu, hamwe na kulanga chila chinhu chija Mulungu chiyalonda uchilonge, na kukimanya chila chinhu chija Mulungu chiyalonda uchimanye. <verse eid="1CO 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 1:6" />Ino yolagusa kua usenga wa Yesu Kilisito uchiwaligulile ni waukweli <verse eid="1CO 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 1:7" />sambi hamuhungukiligwe kubokela dinogile da Mulungu jojose, kuno mobeta kubwela kwake Mndewa wetu Yesu Kilisito. <verse eid="1CO 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 1:8" />Nayo kokwiza kugendelela kuwagela moyo kumsang'hanila Mndewa na habule yolonda yawalamule kua mbananga mbaka zua dija da uhelelo Mndewa wetu Yesu Kilisito vondayabwele. <verse eid="1CO 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 1:9" />Mulungu mazua gose kosang'hana chija chiyalalike kusang'hana, iyo yawakemile mweye muwe na ubwiga na Mwanage, Yesu Kilisito Mndewa wetu.<verse eid="1CO 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuigola kwa bumbila da wamtogole Kilisito</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 1:10" />Mbwiga zangu, nowapuleni kwa udaho wa Mndewa wetu Yesu Kilisito. Muitegeleze kwa chila mbuli zimlonga na seke muihasanye mgati yenu, muitogolele na kwa zija zimtonga na zija zimgesa. <verse eid="1CO 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 1:11" />Wamtogole Kilisito wayangu, mbuli nizipatile kulawa kwa wanhu wamwenga wa kae ya Kuloe, zolagusa hazelu kua hamuilumba goya mmwenu. <verse eid="1CO 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 1:12" />Ima niike goya mbuli ino. Chila munhu mmwenu kolonga jake. Imwe kolonga, “Niye nomuwinza na kumtogola Paulo,” imwenga, “Niye nomuwinza na kumtogola Apolo,” imwenga kolonga, “Niye nomuwinza na kumtogola Kefa,” na imwenga kolonga, “Niye nomuwinza na kumtogola Kilisito.” <verse eid="1CO 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 1:13" />Ivo, Kilisito kaigola mmabumbila? Ivo, Paulo iyo yawambigwe kwa mbuli yenu? Hebu ivo mbatizigwa ili muwe wajalusona wa Paulo? <verse eid="1CO 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 1:14" />Nomwing'ha hewela Mulungu kua simbatize munhu yoyose mmwenu mbali niwabatiza Kilisipo na Gayo waiyeka. <verse eid="1CO 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 1:15" />Baho habule munhu yonda yalonge kabatizigwa ili yawe mjalusona wangu.<verse eid="1CO 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 1:16" />Enaa, nibatiza lukolo lwa Sitefana, mbali sivimanya kama nibatiza munhu imwenga kaidi. <verse eid="1CO 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 1:17" />Kilisito haning'ile sang'hano da kubatiza wanhu, ila kaning'ha sang'hano da kuligula Usenga Unogile, bila kutumanila ugalu wanhu viwalonga, nihasang'hana ivo ili udaho wa ifa ya Yesu mumsalaba seke ioneka yabule chinhu.<verse eid="1CO 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Udaho wa Kilisito na nzewele ya Mulungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 1:18" />Mafundo kwa mbuli ya msalaba gooneka ubozi kwa waja woita kwaga, mbali kumwetu cheye chiloholigwa ni udaho wa Mulungu. <verse eid="1CO 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 1:19" />Mayandiko ga Mulungu gandikigwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CO 1:19">“Nokwiza kuzibananga nzewele zao za weli na nzewele</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CO 1:19">na chowasa kutali umanyi wa weli na ilimu.”<verse eid="1CO 1:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 1:20" />Kakulihi yeli na nzewele? Kakulihi iyo mfunda ndagizi? Nayo kakulihi Galu wa kuibishila? Mulungu kaitenda nzewele ya wanhu wa isi kua ubozi.<verse eid="1CO 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 1:21" />Mulungu kana nzewele, wanhu hawadaha kummanya Mulungu kwa kubitila nzewele zao wenyego. Badili yake Mulungu katumila usenga wa Yesu Kilisito kuwalohola wanhu, uja uwoneka kua ni ubozi kwa wamwenga, mbali waja woutogola usenga uwo woloholigwa. <verse eid="1CO 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 1:22" />Wayahudi wolonda chilaguso ili watogole na Wayunani wolonda nzewele ili watogole, <verse eid="1CO 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 1:23" />mbali cheye chomligula Kilisito yawambigwe mumsalaba. Kwa Wayahudi mbuli ino ng'walo, na kwa Wayunani ni ubozi, <verse eid="1CO 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 1:24" />mbali kwa Wayahudi hebu kwa Wayunani wasaguligwe na Mulungu, Kilisito yawambigwe muumsaba ni udaho wa Mulungu na nzewele ya Mulungu. <verse eid="1CO 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 1:25" />Chija chioneka na wanhu kuwa ni ubozi wa Mulungu, china ulamuzi unogile kubita nzewele ya chiunhu, na chija chioneka kuwa ni uzidilwa wa Mulungu, china udaho kubita ludabwa lwa chiunhu.<verse eid="1CO 1:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 1:26" />Mbwiga zangu, sekemuisemwe chipindi chimkemigwe. Chiunhu wanhu watonga kua wengi wenu mkalabule nzewele. Wengi wakalabule ludabwa hebu kuwa wanhu weli na ukulu. <verse eid="1CO 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 1:27" />Iyo kulonga, Mulungu kagasagula gaja gawayaona wanhu wa isi kua ni ubozi, ili yawagele chinyala weli na nzewele, na kagasagula gaja gawaona wanhu wa isi kua ni uzidilwa ili yawagele chinyala weli na ludabwa. <verse eid="1CO 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 1:28" />Mulungu kawasagula vikumbimuyega waja wozehigwa, ili yawalaguse kua wanhu waja wooneka kua wanhu goya muiisi hawafaya, kasang'hana ivo ili munhu yoyose yaleke kuigoda kwa Mulungu. <verse eid="1CO 1:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 1:29" />Baho habule munhu yodaha kuigodela chochose ha Mulungu. <verse eid="1CO 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 1:30" />Mulungu mwenyego iyo yawadahize kuilumba na Kilisito Yesu. Mulungu kamtenda Kilisito yawe nzewele yetu. Kubitila iyo cheye chotogoligwa na Mulungu, chokua wanhu wake Mulungu na kukomboligwa. <verse eid="1CO 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 1:31" />Baho, kama Mayandiko ga Mulungu vigandikigwe, “Iyo yolonda kuigoda na yaigodele sang'hano ya Mndewa iyasang'hane.<verse eid="1CO 1:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="1CO 2" />
  <para style="s">Usenga wa Yesu yawambigwe mumsalaba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 2:1" />Mbwiga zangu, niye vinizile kumwenu niwalongela mbuli ya kweli ifunuligwe na Mulungu mbali sizile kama munhu yali na ugalu mkulu wa kulonga hebu yali na nzewele ng'hani. <verse eid="1CO 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 2:2" />Vinizile kumwenu silondile kuchimanya chochose ila tu kummanya Yesu Kilisito na chikulu mbuli ya ifa yake muumsalaba. <verse eid="1CO 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 2:3" />Vinikalile kumwenu ng'hala noiona sidaha kusang'hana gaja Yesu gayalonda nisang'hane, nikala nogudema kwa kudumba ng'hani kua sidaha kusang'hana ivo, <verse eid="1CO 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 2:4" />mafundo gangu na kuligula kwangu sigalavile kwa mbuli ya umanyi na nzewele na mbuli za kuwanogeza wanhu, mbali kungangamiza gago ni kubitila udaho wa muhe wa Mulungu. <verse eid="1CO 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 2:5" />Nisang'hana ivo ili kutogola kwenu kutumanile udaho wa Mulungu na sio nzewele ya chiunhu.<verse eid="1CO 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nzewele ya Mulungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 2:6" />Hata ivo, cheye chofunda kwa kutumila ulonzi uli na nzewele kwa waja wanhu wakangale kumtogola Kilisito. Mbali nzewele iyo sio ya wanhu wa muuisi, hebu sio ya vilongozi wa muiisi ino waja ulongozi wao wovika muuhelo.<verse eid="1CO 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 2:7" />Nzewele ichiligula ni nzewele ya Mulungu ija ya kweli, Mulungu kulawa haumwanduso kalonda kuching'ha deng'o jetu ing'hali kulumbigwa isi. <verse eid="1CO 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 2:8" />Ni nzewele ija Vilongozi wa isi ino hawaimanyile, maza waimanyile wahalekile kumuwamba mumsalaba Mndewa wetu yeli na ukulu. <verse eid="1CO 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 2:9" />Mbali kama Mayandiko vigandikigwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CO 2:9">“Habule hata imwe yagaonile na kugahulika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CO 2:9">habule hata imwe yatongile mmoyo wake kua golawila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CO 2:9">gago iyo gaja Mulungu gayawatandile waja wamtogole.”<verse eid="1CO 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 2:10" />Izo izo mbuli zija Mulungu yachidahize kuzimanya kubitila muhe wake. Kwavija Muhe iyo yochimanya chilimgati ng'hani cha Mulungu. <verse eid="1CO 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 2:11" />Habule munhu yovimanya viyatonga munhu imwenga, ila Muhe wa munhu mwenyego. Ivija habule munhu yozimanya mbuli za Mulungu ila Muhe wa Mulungu wenyego.<verse eid="1CO 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 2:12" />Cheye hachibokele muhe wa isi ino, mbali chibokela Muhe kulawa kwa Mulungu ili yachidahize kugamanya gaja gayaching'ile Mulungu.<verse eid="1CO 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 2:13" />Baho cheye chofunda, sio kwa mbuli chifundizigwe na nzewele ya chiunhu, mbali kwa mbuli chifundizigwe na Muhe kwa kufambula mbuli za muhe kwa weli na muhe iyo. <verse eid="1CO 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 2:14" />Munhu ija hamtogola Mulungu habokela mbuli za Muhe wa Mulungu. Munhu iyo kumwake mbuli izo ni ubozi yeka, mbuli izo zobita ubala wake, kwavija yodahika tu kumanyika kwa kutazigwa na Muhe wa Mulungu. <verse eid="1CO 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 2:15" />Mbali munhu yolongozigwa na Muhe wa Mulungu kodaha kugeza na kulamula vija viilondeka, na hawadaha kulamuligwa na wamwenga. <verse eid="1CO 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 2:16" />Mayandiko ga Mulungu gandikigwa, “Yelihi yodaha kuzimanya nzewele za Mndewa? Yelihi yodaka kumlongela Mulungu da kulonga?” Mbali cheye chimtogole chinayo nzewele ya Kilisito.<verse eid="1CO 2:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="1CO 3" />
  <para style="s">Watumigwa wa Mulungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 3:1" />Mbwiga zangu, sidahile kulonga na mweye kama vija wanhu wolongozigwa na Muhe wa Mulungu, ila nilonga na mweye kama wanhu wolongozigwa na maya za ng'huli zenu, kama mwana ching'hele hawamanyile usenga wa Kilisito. <verse eid="1CO 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 3:2" />Niweng'hani matombo mng'we, na sio ndiya ndala, kwa vija mwahapotigwe kuja, <verse eid="1CO 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 3:3" />kwavija mweye mng'hali wanhu mlongozigwa na nhuli zenu. Ivo, si kweli kua mng'hali na maya na uhasanyi mmwenu? Mbuli izo zolagusa hazelu kuwa mweye mng'hali molongozigwa na maya za ng'huli zenu, mokala kama ng'huli zenu vizilonda. <verse eid="1CO 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 3:4" />Imwe imwenu kolonga, “Niye nomuwinza Paulo,” na imwenga, “Niye nomuwinza Apolo,” ivo mweye si wanhu tu?<verse eid="1CO 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 3:5" />Ivo, Apolo ni nani? Na Paulo iyo nani? Ni wasang'hanaji wa Mulungu tu waja kumwao mweye mumtogole Kilisito. Chila imwe mmwetu kosang'hana sang'hano yeng'higwe na Mndewa.<verse eid="1CO 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 3:6" />Niye nihanda mbeyu na Apolo katilila mazi, mbali Mulungu iyo yotenda mbeyu yote. <verse eid="1CO 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 3:7" />Kwa ija yahandile mbeyu hebu kwa yetilile mazi wose si chinhu, mbali chikulu Mulungu yokuza. <verse eid="1CO 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 3:8" />Ija yahandile na ija yatilile mazi habule yambitile miage, ivo chila imwe kobokela gweko jake kwa chija chiyasang'hane. <verse eid="1CO 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 3:9" />Cheye chose chiilumba hamwe na chosang'hana kwambuli ya Mulungu na mweye uwo mgunda wake</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CO 3:9">kaidi mweye ni zengo da Mulungu. <verse eid="1CO 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 3:10" />Kwa kutazigwa na unovu yaning'ile Mulungu nisang'hana goya, kanitenda niwe wa mosi kuwaligulila mweye usenga wa Mulungu kama mzengaji galu yeli na nzewele nika usimikilo na wafundaji wamwenga wokwiza kuwafundani kama munhu imwenga kokwiza kozenga uchanha yake. Baho chila munhu yalole goya kwa chija chiyozenga uchanha yake. <verse eid="1CO 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 3:11" />Habule munhu yodaha kwiza kufunda badili ya ija yasongile, kwavija mafundo gago gabaho tiyali iyo Yesu Kilisito. <verse eid="1CO 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 3:12" />Wafundaji wao wozenga goya kama kwa kuzenga kwa zahabu, mabwe ga feza hebu mabwe ga bei ng'hulu, mbali wafundaji waja hawafunda goya ni kama wozenga kwa kutumila mibiki na mayani hebu nyasi. <verse eid="1CO 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 3:13" />Vovose vondaili, ugalu wa sang'hano da munhu wooneka mdizua dija Yesu vonda yafisule sang'hano izo. Kwavija zua ijo wolawila moto na uo moto woigeza sang'hano iyo na kulagusa ugalu wake. <verse eid="1CO 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 3:14" />Yahawa sang'hano ya munhu kama hailungule muumoto munhu iyo kobokela gweko. <verse eid="1CO 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 3:15" />Mbali kama sang'hano ya munhu yahalungula muumoto hobokela gweko, mbali mwenyego koloholigwa kama munhu yapulusuke kulungula muumoto.<verse eid="1CO 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 3:16" />Ivo, hamvimanya kama mweye iyo ng'anda ya Mulungu, na ivija Muhe wa Mulungu kokala mgati yenu? <verse eid="1CO 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 3:17" />Mulungu kombananga munhu iyo yonda yabanange ng'anda ya Mulungu. Kwavija ng'anda ya Mulungu ni yake iyo yaiyeka na mweye iyo ng'anda ya Mulungu.<verse eid="1CO 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 3:18" />Sekemuivwizile! Munhu yoyose mmwenu yahaigesa kua kana nzewele za muuisi, baho kolondeka yawe mbozi ili yapate nzewele ya kweli. <verse eid="1CO 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 3:19" />Nzewele za wanhu wa isi uwo ubozi ha Mulungu. Kwa vija Mayandiko ga Mulungu gandikigwa, “Mulungu kowagoga weli na nzewele muuubala wao,” <verse eid="1CO 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 3:20" />na Mayandiko gamwenga ga Mulungu gandikigwa, “Mndewa kovimanya kua viwotonga weli na nzewele haifaya chinhu.” <verse eid="1CO 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 3:21" />Baho munhu sekeyaigodele wanhu viwosang'hana. Kwavija wosang'hana kwambuli yenu. <verse eid="1CO 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 3:22" />Sekeuigodele Paulo na Apolo na Kefa, wose wao wenu, hamwe na mbuli zose zilimuiisi na ugima na ifa, mbuli za sambi na zokwiza zose zenu,<verse eid="1CO 3:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 3:23" />mbali mweye ni wanhu wake Kilisito, nayo Kilisito ni wa Mulungu.<verse eid="1CO 3:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="1CO 4" />
  <para style="s">Sang'hano za wasenga wa Kilisito</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 4:1" />Munhu yachione cheye kua wasenga wa Kilisito ching'higwe sang'hano ya kuligula usenga uja Mulungu yang'hali hanawalongela wanhu. <verse eid="1CO 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 4:2" />Munhu yoyose ija yeng'higwe kusang'hana sang'hano za Mulungu kolondeka yawe wakutogoligwa. <verse eid="1CO 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 4:3" />Hamwangu niye sio chinhu nihalamuligwa na mweye kama nisang'hana sang'hano vinogile hebu vihile na chitala cha wanhu, siilamula mwenego ila noiona kua nabule mbuli, <verse eid="1CO 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 4:4" />kwavija silamuligwa kwa jojose, mbali ijo hadinitenda kua nabule mbuli. Mndewa iyo yonilamula. <verse eid="1CO 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 4:5" />Baho sekemumlamule munhu yoyose yahawa chipindi chake ching'hali. Lekeni mbaka vonda yeze Mndewa, iyo kozifisula mbuli zili mdiziza na kulagusa hazelu vija wanhu viwogesa. Baho chila munhu kobokela nhogolwa ilondeka kulawa kwa Mulungu kwa gayasang'hane.<verse eid="1CO 4:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 4:6" />Mbwiga zangu, gago gose ganilongile kwa mbuli ya Apolo na gangu mwenyego ili gawataze, icho chilaguso kumwenu, nisang'hana vino ili mpate kufundigwa na cheye ili muumanye ulonzi uno vuulonga, “Mgagoge goya gaja gandikigwe.” Yoyose mmwenu seke yaikunge kwa munhu imwe na kumzeleu imwenga. <verse eid="1CO 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 4:7" />Yelihi yakutendile kofaya kubita wamwenga? Ivo, hana chinhu gani chija gweye hwing'higwe? Kama kwing'higwa habali koigodela kama vija hwing'higwe?<verse eid="1CO 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 4:8" />Ena, moiona kua mwiguta? Moiona kua wazenzi? Moiona kua wafaume bila cheye, maza yahawile goya kama mwahawile kweli wafaume ili na cheye chihalongoze hamwe na mweye. <verse eid="1CO 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 4:9" />Nogesa Mulungu kachitenda cheye watumigwa chiwe wanhu wa chikomelezo kabisa, kama wanhu walamuligwe kukomigwa, kwavija cheye chooneka wanhu wa wakuzehigwa wa kuloligwa na wanhu wa isi zose, na ha watumigwa wa kwa kuulanga kwa Mulungu na wanhu. <verse eid="1CO 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 4:10" />Wanhu wochiona cheye chawabozi kwa mbuli ya Kilisito, mbali mweye iyo mli na nzewele vumuuilumbile na Kilisito! Cheye china uzidilwa, mbali mweye moiona mna ludabwa. Cheye wochizeleu mbali mweye moiona wakutogoligwa. <verse eid="1CO 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 4:11" />Mbaka vino sambi cheye china nzala na ng'ilu, chabule chivalo, chotoigwa mang'hua na chabule hakuwasa, <verse eid="1CO 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 4:12" />choiyoha kusang'hana sang'hano zetu kwa makono getu wenyego. Chahaligigwa, chowapulila ganogile ga Mulungu wao wochiliga, chahaoneligwa cheye chofunya moyo, <verse eid="1CO 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 4:13" />chahalongwa vihile kwa gaja hachigatendile, chowedika goya. Mbaka sambi chitendigwa kama unyolodo wa muuisi na chila munhu kuchiona cheye hachifaya chinhu!<verse eid="1CO 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 4:14" />Sizandika mbuli zino kwa kuwagela chinyala, mbali kwa mbuli ya kuwafunda mweye wanangu wa wende. <verse eid="1CO 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 4:15" />Hata mwahawa na maelufu ya wanhu wa kuwagalila Usenga Unogile, Tata yenu ni imwe tu. Kwa vija kubitila kuilumba na Kilisito niye iyo niwalelile kubitila kuligula Usenga Unogile. <verse eid="1CO 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 4:16" />Ivo, nompuleni mnige niye vinisang'hana. <verse eid="1CO 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 4:17" />Kwa mbuli iyo nimlagiza Timoteo kumwenu, iyo mwanangu wa wende na yotogolingwa kubitila kuilumba na Mndewa. Nimtuma ili yawe kowakumbusa gaja ganiwinza kubitila Kilisito Yesu, gaja ganifunda wanhu mmabumbila gose ga wamtogole Kilisito.<verse eid="1CO 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 4:18" />Wamwenga wenu wasonga udulu wagesa kua niye siza kaidi kumwenu. <verse eid="1CO 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 4:19" />Mbali Mndewa yahalonda, nolopola nokwiza kumwenu, na baho honda niionele mwenyego sio tu chija chowodaha kulonga wao wadulu, mbali ivija kuumanya udaho wao wakumtogola Kilisito. <verse eid="1CO 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 4:20" />Ufaume wa Mulungu sio tu mbuli ya kulonga kuiyeka, ila kua na udaho wa Mulungu ivija. <verse eid="1CO 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 4:21" />Molonda nhende choni? Nize na luboko hebu nize kwa moyo wa wende na uhole?<verse eid="1CO 4:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="1CO 5" />
  <para style="s">Luhadu haulondeka mdibumbila da wamtogole Kilisito</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 5:1" />Yolongeleka kua hana mbuli ya luhadu mmwenu, kaidi ni luhadu wihile uja haunalawilila hata kwa wanhu waja hawammanyile Mulungu. Nilongiligwa kua imwe mmwenu kowasa na mwehe wa tata yake! <verse eid="1CO 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 5:2" />Modahaze kuikunga? Maza yahawile yofaya ng'hani kumwenu kua na giogio na kumsegeza mmwenu munhu iyo. <verse eid="1CO 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 5:3" />Hata kama nahatali na mweye kumli, mbali kwa Muhe na hamwe na mweye, kama vija nikala baho na nimala kumlamula munhu yatendile mbuli iyo ya chinyala. <verse eid="1CO 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 5:4" />Chipindi vonda muilumbe hamwe kwa kumfugamila Mndewa Yesu, na niye nahamwe na mweye kwa muhe, baho kubitila muhe wa Mndewa wetu Yesu, <verse eid="1CO 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 5:5" />mwing'heni Mwenembago munhu iyo ili lukuli lwake ubanangingwe na muhe wake udahe kuloholigwa mdizua dija da Mndewa.<verse eid="1CO 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 5:6" />Kuikunga kwenu hakufaya! Ivo, hammanyile kua, “Hamila chidogo yosasula bulunge jose da usage wa ngano.” <verse eid="1CO 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 5:7" />Ivo muwe moinang'hana mmoyo kwa kumbagula munhu mbananzi mmwenu kama kulava hamila ya mwaka, mbali muwe kama bulunge da ngano da sambi dilibule hamila. Vino ivo mwili, kwavija Mulungu kamlava Kilisito yawe kama mwana bung'hukilalo wetu wa Pasaka kalavigwa yawe nhosa ili yachilohole. <verse eid="1CO 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 5:8" />Sambi chileke kuja ndia ya Pasaka kwa hamila ya mwaka, manake ubananzi na malozo, mbali chije ndia kwa migate ilibule hamila iyo moyo unang'hane na kweli.<verse eid="1CO 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 5:9" />Muibalua yangu iniwandikile sekemuilumbe na wagoni. <verse eid="1CO 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 5:10" />Sio kama mleke kuilumba na wanhu wose muiisi, na wamwenga kama wagoni hebu wamelo na wavwizi, hebu waja wofugamila milungu ya nyang'iti. Kwavija kwa kusang'hana ivo mkala molondeka kuhalawa muiisi ino dimwe kwa dimwe. <verse eid="1CO 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 5:11" />Chinyandike ni chino sekemuilumbe na munhu mkilisito yeli mgoni hebu mgila hebu yofugamila milungu ya nyang'iti hebu msovula ndwagi hebu munhu yokoligwa na mvwizi. Munhu kama iyo hata ndiya sekemje nayo. <verse eid="1CO 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 5:12" />Ivo, sio sang'hano yangu kuwalamula bumbila da wanhu wamwenga wamtole Kilisito? Baho Mulungu mwenyego kowalamula, mbali nolondeka niwalamule wanhu waja weli mdimbula jenu. Kama Mayandiko vigandikigwe,<verse eid="1CO 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 5:13" />“Muwingeni mmwenu munhu mbananzi.”<verse eid="1CO 5:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="1CO 6" />
  <para style="s">Sekemuigale mchitala</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 6:1" />Yodahikaze mtogola Kilisito yahagomba na miage kumlongeleza mtogola Kilisito miage mchitala cha wanhu hawammanyile Mulungu? Ivo halondeka kumgala kwa wamtogole Kilisito wayage ili wamlamule?<verse eid="1CO 6:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 6:2" />Ivo, hamvimanya kua wanhu wamtogole Kilisito iyo wowalamula wanhu wa isi ino? Kama mweye mumtogola Kilisito modaha kulamula wanhu wa isi ino mopotwaze kulamula mbuli ndodo mmwenu? <verse eid="1CO 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 6:3" />Ivo, hamvimanyile kua, hata kama chihalamula mbuli za chila zua, chowalamula hata watumigwa wa kwa Mulungu? <verse eid="1CO 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 6:4" />Mwahagomba kwa mbuli za mazoela, na habali mozigala mbuli zenu kwa walamuzi waja hawatogoligwa na wamtogole Kilisito? <verse eid="1CO 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 6:5" />Chinyala kumwenu! Iyo kulonga habule hata muhnu imwe mmwenu yeli na nzewele yadahile kulamula mbuli za wamtogole Kilisito? <verse eid="1CO 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 6:6" />Mbali mweye muna mazoela ga munhu kumlongeleza mtogola Kilisito miage kwa waja hawamtogole Kilisito.<verse eid="1CO 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 6:7" />Kweli, vumuilongeleza wenyego kwa wenyego kolagusa kua mpotigwa kabisa! Ivo, ihawile goya ng'hani kumwenu kutendiligwa gehile? Ivo, ihawile goya ng'hani kumwenu kubunzigwa vinhu venu? <verse eid="1CO 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 6:8" />Mbali, badili yake, mweye iyo mowabunza wanhu na kuwaboka kaidi gago mowatendela wamtogole Kilisito wayenu! <verse eid="1CO 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 6:9" />Sekemuivwizile, hammanyile kua wanhu wowatendela gehile wabule nyafasi ya muufaume wa Mulungu. Nolonga kwa mbuli ya weli na luhadu, wofugamila milungu ya nyang'iti hebu wagoni hebu woisola walume kwa walume <verse eid="1CO 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 6:10" />hebu wabavi na wamelo na wakoligwe na vibilikizi na wabokaji wose hondawengile muufume wa Mulungu. <verse eid="1CO 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 6:11" />Wamwenga wenu mkala ivo, mbali sambi msunhigwa ubananzi wenu na mtendigwa wanhu wa Mulungu, na kutendigwa wana wanogile na mulumbigwa na Mulungu kwa kubitila Mndewa Yesu Kilisito na kwa Muhe wa Mulungu wetu.<verse eid="1CO 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tumileni ng'huli zenu kumtogola Mulungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 6:12" />Munhu imwe mmwenu kodaha kulonga, “Kumwangu niye chila chinhu chofaya.” Ena, mbali sio chila chinu chofaya kumwenu. Ena chila chinhu chofaya kumwangu, mbali silonda nilongozigwe na chinhu chochose. <verse eid="1CO 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 6:13" />Munhu imwenga mmwenu kolonga, “Haja chihawa na nzala cholondeka kuja, kwavija ng'huli zolonda ndia.” Ena ivoili, mbali chokwiza chipindi Mulungu kohindula ng'huli zetu zokua hazilonda ndia. Mbali sambi sekemulonge kua molondeka kutenda ugoni. <verse eid="1CO 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 6:14" />Baho, Mulungu kokwiza kuchizilibula na cheye kwa udaho wake kama viyamzilibule Mndewa Yesu kulawa muiifa.<verse eid="1CO 6:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 6:15" />Ivo, hammanyile kua ng'huli zenu ni vilungo va lukuli lwa Kilisito? Ivo, chilungo cha lukuli lwa kilisito kodaha kwika lukuli lumwe na munhu yeli na luhadu? Habule! <verse eid="1CO 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 6:16" />Munhu yotenda ugoni kokua lukuli lumwe na yeli na luhadu. Kama Mayandiko vigandikigwe, “Waidi wano wokua lukuli lumwe.” <verse eid="1CO 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 6:17" />Mbali munhu yoyose yailumbile na Mndewa kokua muhe umwe na Mndewa.<verse eid="1CO 6:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 6:18" />Inegeni kabisa na ugoni. Malozo gamwenga gose gotendigwa muinzewele ya munhu na sio mulukuli mbali mgoni kotenda malozo mulukuli lwake mwenyego. <verse eid="1CO 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 6:19" />Ivo, hammanyile kua ng'huli zenu ni ng'anda ya Muhe wa Mulungu yokala mgati yenu, ija imumbokele kulawa kwa Mulungu? Ng'uli zenu sio yenu wenyewe ila mwenyego ni Mulungu, <verse eid="1CO 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 6:20" />mguligwa kwa bei ng'hulu. Kwaivo, zisang'hanileni ng'huli zenu kwa mbuli ya kumfugamila Mulungu.<verse eid="1CO 6:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="1CO 7" />
  <para style="s">Mahala ga zengele</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 7:1" />Sambi ima niwafambulile kwambuli zija mnyandikile,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CO 7:1">Molonga kua, “Ihawile goya kama mulume yahalekile kusola,” <verse eid="1CO 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 7:2" />mbali kwa vija hana mbuli nyingi za ugoni, baho, chila mulume na yasole mwehe wake mwenyego, na chila muke yawe na mulume wake mwenyego. <verse eid="1CO 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 7:3" />Mulume yatende gaja galondeka kwambuli ya mwehe wake, nayo mwehe yatende gaja galondeka kwambuli ya mulume wake. <verse eid="1CO 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 7:4" />Mwehe kabule ulamuzi kwambuli ya lukuli lwake mbali mulume wake kanao, na ivija mulume kabule ulamuzi kwa lukuli lwake mbali mwehe wake kanao. <verse eid="1CO 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 7:5" />Sekemuime, mbali kama muhaitogolela kutenda ivo kwa chipindi chiguhi tu, ili mpate nyafasi ya kumpula Mulungu, amala muibwelele kaidi ili Mwenembago seke yawageze kwa mbuli ya kuleka kufunyamoyo kwenu.<verse eid="1CO 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 7:6" />Niwalongela mbuli izo kua, niwatogolela mleke kwa chipindi chiguhi tu kwa kumfugamila mulungu, sio kua nolonda kumswangizani. <verse eid="1CO 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 7:7" />Kweli ihawile kama vinilonda wanhu wose wawe kama nie vinili, mbali haili ivo, kwavija chila munhu Mulungu kamwing'ha nhunza yake, imwe nhunza ino na imwenga nhuza ija.<verse eid="1CO 7:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 7:8" />Baho nowalongela waja hawanasola na wagane ihawile goya wakale ivo ivo kama vinili nie. <verse eid="1CO 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 7:9" />Hata ivo, kama hawadaha kuikimila, baho yofaya wasole hebu kusoligwa, kwavija yofaya ng'hani kutenda ivo kubita kupata maya ya ng'huli zenu.<verse eid="1CO 7:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 7:10" />Kwa waja wasolile, nina lagizo jao, kaidi si jangu, ila dilawa kwa Mndewa. Mwehe sekeyamleke mulume wake, <verse eid="1CO 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 7:11" />kama yahamleka sekeyasoligwe na imwenga, la wailumbe na mulume wake waibwelele. Mulume nayo seke yamwase mwehe wake.<verse eid="1CO 7:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 7:12" />Sambi nolonga na wanhu wamwenga. Gano ganilonga sambi sio malagizo ga Mndewa ila gangu mwenyego, yahawa mulume Mkilisito kana mwehe hamtogole Kilisito, na iyo mwehe katogola kugendelela kukala nayo baho sekeyamwase mwehe wake. <verse eid="1CO 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 7:13" />Nayo mwanachike mkilisito kanayo mulume hamtogole Kilisito, na iyo mulume katogola kukala na mwehe iyo, nayo sekeyamuleke mulume wake.<verse eid="1CO 7:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 7:14" />Baho mulume ija hamtogole Kilisito, kobokeligwa kwa kumfugamila Mulungu kwambuli ya kuilumba na mwehe wake, nayo mwehe ija hamtogole Kilisito kobokeligwa kwa kuilumba na mulume wake mtogola Kilisito. Maza si ivo, wana wao wahalekile kua wana wa Mulungu, kumbe sambi wana wake Mulungu. <verse eid="1CO 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 7:15" />Hata ivo yahawa munhu ija hamtogole Kilisito kolonda kumleka miage yeli mkilisito, baho na yamleke tu. Baho iyo mkilisito mulume hebu muke koilegeha. Kwavija Mulungu kamkemani mweye mkale kwa utindiwala. <verse eid="1CO 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 7:16" />Gweye mumke mkilisito, kodahaze kuvimanya kua hudaha kumlohola mulume wako? Hebu gweye mulume mkilisito, kodahaze kuvimanya kua hudaha kumlohola mwehe wako?<verse eid="1CO 7:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kala kama vuukemigwe na Mulungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 7:17" />Munhu yoyose na yakale kuilinga na vija Mndewa viyamtandile kukala, na kama vija viyakemigwe na Mulungu. Dino ijo lagizo jangu kwa bumbila da wamtogole Kilisito wose weli chila hanhu.<verse eid="1CO 7:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 7:18" />Kama munhu kakemigwa kuno kakala kengila kumbi, baho sekeyalonge kua hanakwingila kumbi, na kama viyakemigwe kakala hengile kumbi, baho sekeyengile kumbi. <verse eid="1CO 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 7:19" />Kwavija kwingila kumbi hebu kuleka kwingila kumbi si chinhu, chilondeka ng'hani ni kuzitegeleza ndagizi za Mulungu.<verse eid="1CO 7:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 7:20" />Baho, chila imwe na yasigale kama viyakalile chipindi viyakemigwe.<verse eid="1CO 7:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 7:21" />Seke uone vihile yahawa kukemigwa na Mulungu uli mtumwa. Mbali uhapata nyafasi ya kuikombola baho tenda ivo. <verse eid="1CO 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 7:22" />Baho iyo yakemigwe na Mndewa yeli mtumwa iyo kokua heli mtumwa. Na ivija kwa ija yakemigwe heli mtumwa, iyo kokua mtumwa wa Kilisito. <verse eid="1CO 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 7:23" />Mose mguligwa na Mulungu kwa bei ng'hulu, kwaivo seke muwe watumwa wa wanhu kaidi. <verse eid="1CO 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 7:24" />Mbwiga zangu, chila munhu mmwenu na yakale goya na Mulungu kama viyakalile haja viyakemigwe.<verse eid="1CO 7:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mbuli ya walume hawasolile na wagane</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 7:25" />Sambi kwa mbuli ya wandele waja hawanasoligwa, nabule ndagizi kulawa kwa Mndewa, mbali nolava ulonzi wangu kwa bazi jake Mndewa molondeka kunitogola.<verse eid="1CO 7:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 7:26" />Baho, kwa mbuli ndala ilibaha, notonga kua yofaya munhu yahakala kama viyeli. <verse eid="1CO 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 7:27" />Ivo, kusola? baho sekeumwase mwehe wako. Gweye hunasola? baho sekeusole. <verse eid="1CO 7:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 7:28" />Mbali kama uhasola kokua kwabule malozo, na kwa mndele yaheza kusoligwa hawa munhu yeli na malozo. Wao wondakwiza kuisola hawapatigwa na mbuli za muisi ino, mbali niye maza nihalondile gago seke gawapate mweye.<verse eid="1CO 7:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 7:29" />Mbwiga nolonda kulonga vino, chipindi chisigale chiguhi, na kulawa sambi, waja wasolile na wakale kama vija hawasolile,<verse eid="1CO 7:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 7:30" />waja wolila wakale kama hawalila, na waja wodeng'helela wakale kama hawadeng'helela, waja wogula wakale kama walibule chinhu, <verse eid="1CO 7:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 7:31" />nao waja weli na sang'hano za muuisi ino wakale kama wabule ng'hani sang'hano izo. Kwavija isi ino kama vichiimanyile yobita.<verse eid="1CO 7:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CO 7:32" />Vinilonda niye mweye sekemgaye. Munhu yalibule mwehe iyo kosang'hanika na sang'hano za Mndewa na kwavija kolonda kumnogeza Mndewa. <verse eid="1CO 7:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CO 7:33" />Mulume yasolile mwehe iyo kohunganikila mbuli za muiisi vija vonda yamnogeze mwehe wake, <verse eid="1CO 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CO 7:34" />nayo kaigola mzimbuli mbili. Mwanachike ija hanasoligwa hebu mhambe kohunganika na mbuli za Mndewa ili yaulave lukuli na muhe kwa Mndewa, mbali mwehe yasoligwe nayo kohunganikila mbuli za muiisi, kwavija konda yamnogeze mulume wake.<verse eid="1CO 7:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="1CO 7:35" />Nowalongeni gano ili nimtazeni, na sio kwa kuwakimila. Mbali nolonda mkale goya ili mdahe kumsang'hanila Mndewa vinogile.<verse eid="1CO 7:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="1CO 7:36" />Kama munhu koona kua hamtendela goya kuleka kumsola yamfungile pamvu, kaidi hata kama chipindi chake cha kusoligwa chibita, na munhu iyo koona yofaya waisole, na yatende kama viyalonda, waisole. Baho hatenda malozo bule. <verse eid="1CO 7:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1CO 7:37" />Mbali kama mbwanga yahaona mwenyego kua hasola, na kofunya moyo kumleka mhambe iyo kama viyeli, kokua katenda goya. <verse eid="1CO 7:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1CO 7:38" />Kwaivo, mulume ija yosola mndele wake ija yamfungile pamvu, kotenda goya. Nayo ija hasola, kotenda goya ng'hani.<verse eid="1CO 7:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="1CO 7:39" />Mwehe yasoligwe kolongozigwa na mulume wake kwa chipindi chose mulume wake yahawa mgima. Mbali mulume wake yahadanganika, mwehe iyo kokua halongozigwa na mulume wake ila kodaha kusoligwa na mulume yoyose yomlonda. Mbali mulume iyo yawe mjalusona wa Kilisito. <verse eid="1CO 7:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1CO 7:40" />Mbali viniona niye komweda mgane iyo yahakala bila kusoligwa. Gano ganilonga ni gangu niye, notonga kua ninayo Muhe wa Mulungu..<verse eid="1CO 7:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="1CO 8" />
  <para style="s">Ndiya zilavigwe kutambikila milungu ya nyang'iti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 8:1" />Sambi kwambuli ya ndiya zitambikiligwe milungu ya nyang'iti. Chovimanya kua, “Cheye chose china umanyi,” mbali umanyi uwo wowatenda wanhu wawe na magoda, mbali wende wozenga wanhu kuwataza wamwenga.<verse eid="1CO 8:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 8:2" />Waja wotonga kua womanya chila chinhu, kweli hawavimanya chochose kama viilondeka. <verse eid="1CO 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 8:3" />Mbali yomtogola Mulungu, iyo Mulungu kommanya.<verse eid="1CO 8:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 8:4" />Kwaivo, kwa mbuli ya ndiya itambikigiligwe milungu ya nyang'iti, chovimanya kua milungu yanyang'iti si chinhu muuisi, kaidi chovimanya kua Mulungu ni imwe tu. <verse eid="1CO 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 8:5" />Hata kama hana vinhu vokemigwa “milungu,” muuisi hebu kuulanga kwa Mulungu, na hata kama hana “milungu“ na “wandewa.” wengi, <verse eid="1CO 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 8:6" />hata ivo, kumwetu cheye hana Mulungu imwe tu, Tata yalumbile vose, ija kwa mbuli yake cheye chabaha. Ivija hana Mndewa imwe tu Yesu Kilisito, ija kwa mbuli yake vinhu vose vilumbigwa, na cheye chokala kwambuli yake.<verse eid="1CO 8:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 8:7" />Mbali si chila munhu kana umanyi uno. Kwavija hana wanhu wamwenga weli na mazoela ga kufugamila milungu ya nyang'iti, wanhu waja mbaka vino sambi woja ndiya woiona ing'hali kama ndiya itambikiligwe milungu ya nyang'iti. Kwavija hawakangale kumtogola Mulungu, ivo wopotigwa kutogoligwa kumfugamila Mulungu. <verse eid="1CO 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 8:8" />Mbali ndiya haidaha kuchigala behi na Mulungu. Hata chahaleka kuja, hachongezekiligwa chinhu, chihaja hachongezeligwa chinhu chochose na Mulungu.<verse eid="1CO 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 8:9" />Mbali itiganyeni, umanyi wenu, sekeuwatende wahungukiligwe kumtogola Mulungu wagwe mmalozo. <verse eid="1CO 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 8:10" />Kwavija, munhu ija hakangale kumtogola Mulungu, yahakuona gweye uli na umanyi koja ndiya izo muing'anda ya milungu ya nyang'iti, ivo, hagesa mmoyo wake kuja ndiya ilavigwe kwa milungu ya nyang'iti?<verse eid="1CO 8:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 8:11" />Kwaivo miago iyo, hakangale kumtogola Mulungu ija Kilisito kadanganika kwambuli yake, kokwaga kwambuli ya umanyi wako. <verse eid="1CO 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 8:12" />Kwaivo, mweye muwagiza wayenu waja hawakangale kumtogola Mulungu watende malozo, na kuwalumiza mioyo yao, baho mokua momhasanya Kilisito mwenyego. <verse eid="1CO 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 8:13" />Kwaivo, yahawa ndiya iyo inija yomuhonza mtogola Kilisito miangu yatende malozo, baho sija nyama ng'o, sekenimuhonze miangu yagwe mmalozo.<verse eid="1CO 8:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="1CO 9" />
  <para style="s">Chiyalondeka kusang'hana msenga na chiyalondeka kwing'higwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 9:1" />Mvimanya kua niye si mtumwa? Mvimanya kua niye sio msenga wa Mulungu? Ivo nie simuonile Mndewa wetu Yesu? Kaidi sang'hano yangu inisang'hane haimtendani mweye kumtogola Mndewa? <verse eid="1CO 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 9:2" />Hata kama kwa wanhu wamwenga woniona nie sio msenga wa Mulungu, mbali kumwenu mweye niye ni msenga wa Mulungu, kwavija kumtogola Kilisito kwenu ni chilaguso kua nie nhumigwa na Mndewa.<verse eid="1CO 9:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 9:3" />Kwaivo kwa waja wonilonga nie sio msenga chino icho chinimila. <verse eid="1CO 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 9:4" />Ivo, nie kwa sang'hano yangu silondeka kwing'higwa ndia kuja na kung'wa? <verse eid="1CO 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 9:5" />Ivo, mogesa nie nopotigwa kugenda mwanza na mwehe yamtogole Kilisito kama viwogenda nao wasenga wamwenga na wadodo zake Mndewa na Kefa yokemigwa Petulo ivija? <verse eid="1CO 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 9:6" />Hebu niye na Balaba tu iyo hachilondeka kwing'higwa chakuja kwa sang'hano ichisang'hana? <verse eid="1CO 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 9:7" />Ivo, mmilizi gani yoilihila sang'hano yake mdi jeshi? Mlimi gani honda yaje manhunda ga mgunda wake wa mizabibu? Msusilaji gani honda yang'we maziwa ga wanyama wake?<verse eid="1CO 9:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 9:8" />Ivo, nolonga mbuli zino kama chiunhu tu? Ivo, ndagizi za Mulungu yeng'higwe Musa nazo hazilonga ivo? <verse eid="1CO 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 9:9" />Yandikigwa muindagizi, “Sekeumfumbe mulomo ng'ombe yahapiga ngano.” Ivo, kwa ulonzi uno iyo kulonga Mulungu kohunganikila ng'ombe waiyeka? <verse eid="1CO 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 9:10" />Ivo, hakalile yochitonga cheye viyakalile yolonga ivo? Ena, gano gandikigwa kwa mbuli yetu, kwavija ija yolima na ija yobiga, wose waidi wolondeka kubokela mgelo wake. <verse eid="1CO 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 9:11" />Sambi cheye chiligula Usenga Unogile kumwenu kama munhu yohanda mbeyu, ivo, ni mbuli ng'hulu kwing'higwa vinhu kulawa kumwenu va kuchitaza kwakuja na kung'wa kama munhu yogobola? <verse eid="1CO 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 9:12" />Yahawa wamwenga wolondeka kulolela gago kulawa kumwenu, ivo, cheye vilihi hachilondeka kubokela ng'hani kubita wao? Mbali, cheye hachisang'hane kama vichilondeka. Badili yake, chifunya moyo kwa chila chinhu ili sekechike udala wowose mu Usenga Unogile wa Kilisito. <verse eid="1CO 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 9:13" />Ivo, hammanyile kua iyo yosang'hana Muing'anda ya Mulungu kopata ndia yake mui nganda iyo, na yosang'hana mchilemela kopata ndia kulawa muiyo nhosa? <verse eid="1CO 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 9:14" />Mndewa kalagiza ivo ivo, woligula Usenga Unogile wapate ndia yao kwa sang'hano iyo.<verse eid="1CO 9:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 9:15" />Mbali, niye sipulile hata mala lumwe mwa gaja ganilondeke kusang'haniligwa. Ivija sandika gano ili nhendeligwe ivo, kumwangu niye noona yofaya nidanganike kubita munhu yoyose kunikimila kuikunga kuligula Usenga Unogile bila kulihigwa. <verse eid="1CO 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 9:16" />Nie silondeka kuikunga kwambuli ya kuligula Usenga Unogile, kwavija ijo ijo nilagizigwe kudisang'hana, kaidi noluona kama siligula Usenga Unogile! <verse eid="1CO 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 9:17" />Kama nihaisagule mwenyego sang'hano ino, baho nihatumanile kulihigwa, mbali sambi nolondeka kuisang'hana kwavija iyo sang'hano yangu ining'higwe na Mulungu niisang'hane kama viyalonda. <verse eid="1CO 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 9:18" />Chitumetume changu ni chilihi baho? Chitumetume changu ni nyafasi ya kuuligula Usenga Unogile bila kulonda chochose chilondeka kwa mbuli ya kuligula usenga uno.<verse eid="1CO 9:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 9:19" />Kwaivo, niye sio mtumwa wa munhu yoyose, niitenda kua mtumwa wa chila munhu ili niwatende wanhu wengi kama viidahika wamtogole Kilisito. <verse eid="1CO 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 9:20" />Vinikalile nosang'hana kwa Wayahudi, nikala kama Myahudi ili niwapate Wayahudi, hata kama niye si munhu wa kulongozigwa na ndagizi, mbali niika mwenyego kama munhu wa ndagizi ili niwapate wao wolongozigwa na ndagizi.<verse eid="1CO 9:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 9:21" />Kwa waja haweli Wayahudi, nikala kama wao bila kuzitogola ndagizi, ili niwapate waja haweli Wayahudi wamtogole Kilisito. <verse eid="1CO 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 9:22" />Kwa waja vikumbi muyega nanie niitenda kama wao ili niwapate wao vikumbi muyega wamtogole Kilisito. Nitenda chila chinhu kwa wose ili kwa chila nzila mhate kuwalohola wamwenga wao.<verse eid="1CO 9:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 9:23" />Nogasang'hana gano gose kwambuli ya Usenga Unogile ili mhate kuilumba na wamwenga kwa kubokela ganogile ga Mulungu gayachilalike. Kimbileni vija kila munhu vonda yabokele gweko <verse eid="1CO 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 9:24" />Ivo, hamvimanyile kua waja woihuma kukimbila mbio, wose wokimbila mbio, mbali imwe tu mmwao iyo yobokela gweko? <verse eid="1CO 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 9:25" />Wose wokwingila kuihuma wokimbila mazua gose, wosang'hana kwa kuiyoha ili wadahe kuhuma na kupata gweko dija dibanangika. Gweko diwabokela hazikala mazua gose dobanangika, mbali gweko jetu dokala mazua gose hadibanangika. <verse eid="1CO 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 9:26" />Ivo nokimbila kama munhu yeli na nhamanilo da kuhuma. Noitoa ng'onde kama munhu yotoa mbeho, sio kama munhu yotoa beho. <verse eid="1CO 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 9:27" />Noukimila lukuli lwangu kwa kuutenda unitegeleze kwa chila mbuli inilonda kuisang'hana. Nosang'hana ivo ili nie mwenyego sekeniihonye nhunza haja inihawaligulila wayangu Usenga Unogile.<verse eid="1CO 9:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="1CO 10" />
  <para style="s">Seke mufugamile milungu ya nyang'iti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 10:1" />Mbwiga zangu, nolonda mvimanye kua wasao wetu viwakalile wobita muiisi ya luwala, wose wakala wolongozigwa na wingu, kaidi wose wabita hagati ya bahali ndung'hu. <verse eid="1CO 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 10:2" />Viwalongozigwe na wingu na kubita hagati ya bahali wose wakala wabatizigwa na kua wajalusona wa Musa. <verse eid="1CO 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 10:3" />Wose waja ndia iija ilavigwe kulawa uchanha kwa Mulungu <verse eid="1CO 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 10:4" />na wang'wa mazi galavigwe na Muhe wa Mulungu, wang'wa kulawa mdibwe kulu dikalile dogenda nawo, iyo Kilisito mwenyego. <verse eid="1CO 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 10:5" />Hata ivo wengi wao Mulungu hanogeligwe nao, ivo wadanganika na mitufi yao ipwililika muluala.<verse eid="1CO 10:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 10:6" />Sambi gano gose gakwiga kumwetu, kochilakila cheye sekechilonde gehile kama viwasang'hane wao. <verse eid="1CO 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 10:7" />Seke muifugamile milungu ya nyang'iti kama viwatendile wanhu wamwenga, kama Mayandiko vigolonga, “Wanhu wakala woja na kung'wa, amala wema na kuvina chaka chaka kama wanhu hawammanyile Mulungu.” <verse eid="1CO 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 10:8" />Hebu sekemtende ugoni kama wamwenga wao viwatendile, wanhu ishilini na nhatu elufu wadanganika mdizua dimwe. <verse eid="1CO 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 10:9" />Seke chimgeze Mndewa kama wanhu wamwenga viwamgizile, kwambuli iyo walumigwa na nyoka wadanganika. <verse eid="1CO 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 10:10" />Sekemnung'hunike kama wamwenga viwatendile, na wakomigwa na mtumigwa wa kubananga wa kwa Mulungu.<verse eid="1CO 10:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 10:11" />Baho mbuli izo zose ziwapatile wao, zandikigwa ili gawe chilaguso kuchilakila cheye waja chikala mmazua gano gachikomelezo.<verse eid="1CO 10:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 10:12" />Kwaivo yoigesa kua kema goya kumtogola Mulungu, na yaitiganye seke yagwe mmalozo. <verse eid="1CO 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 10:13" />Magezo gampatile gago golawililaga kwa wamwenga chila zua. Mumtumanile Mulungu iyo hawaleka mgezigwe kubita vija udaho wenu. Haja muhagezigwa, komwing'hani udaho wa kufunya moyo na nzila ya kulawila.<verse eid="1CO 10:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 10:14" />Kwaivo mbwiga zangu, inegeni kufugamila milungu ya nyang'iti. <verse eid="1CO 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 10:15" />Nolonga na mweye kama wanhu mli na nzewele, gatongeni goya gano ganilonga. <verse eid="1CO 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 10:16" />Vichimwing'ha hewela Mulungu kwa chikombe chikitumila kwa ndia ya Mndewa, ivo hua hachiilumba hamwe kung'wa damu ya Kilisito? Na vichiumega mgate, ivo, hachiilumba hamwe kuja lukuli lwa Kilisito? <verse eid="1CO 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 10:17" />Kwa vija mgate uwo ni umwe, na cheye chili wengi cha lukuli lumwe, kwavija choilumba kuja mgate uwo umwe.<verse eid="1CO 10:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 10:18" />Loleni kama viweli Wayahudi wenyego, waja woja ndia itambikiligwe mchilemela, baho woilumba na kuija mchilemela. <verse eid="1CO 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 10:19" />Nolonda kulonga choni baho? Kua nyama itambikiligwe na milungu ya nyang'iti ni chinhu goya kubita ndia? Ivo, milungu ya nyang'iti ni mulungu kweli? <verse eid="1CO 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 10:20" />Habule! Chinilonga ni kua nhambiko wozilava wanhu hawammanyile Mulungu wovilavila vinyamkela, na sio Mulungu. Silonda mbe mweye muilumbe na wotambikila vinyamkela. <verse eid="1CO 10:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 10:21" />Hamdaha kung'wela chikombe cha Mndewa na chikombe cha vinyamkela, na hamdaha kuilumba kuja ndia muimeza ya Mndewa na mje ndia muimeza ya chinyamkela. <verse eid="1CO 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 10:22" />Hebu, chonda chimtende Mndewa yawe na migongo? Mogesa cheye china ludabwa ng'hani kubita iyo?<verse eid="1CO 10:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 10:23" />Molonga,wanhu wamwenga wolonga, “Ching'higwa ludabwa wa kusang'hana chochose,” Iyo kweli, mbali sio chila chinhu chofaya. “Ching'higwa nyafasi ya kusang'hana chila chinhu,” mbali sio chila chinhu chotaza wanhu kugangamala kwa kumtola Mulungu. <verse eid="1CO 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 10:24" />Iyoheni kuwasang'hanila ganogile wayenu badili ya kusang'hana ganogile gako mwenyego.<verse eid="1CO 10:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 10:25" />Dieni nyama ija iguligwa mdigulilo bila ya kuiuzauza ili sekemdununzike mmoyo. <verse eid="1CO 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 10:26" />Kwavija Mayandiko ga Mulungu gandikigwa, “Isi na vose viliumo ni va Mndewa.”<verse eid="1CO 10:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 10:27" />Munhu hamtogole Kilisito yahawagoneka kuja ndia yahawa moita baho dieni chochose chimwing'higwe. Seke muiuzeuze kwa chochose ili seke muigaze mmoyo. <verse eid="1CO 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 10:28" />Mbali munhu yahawalongeleni, “Ino nyama itambikiligwa na milungu ya nyang'iti,” baho seke mje kwavija chodaha kubananga kumtogola Mulungu. <verse eid="1CO 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 10:29" />Hano nolongela sio kwambuli ya kulumiza kutonga kwetu, mbali kwa ija yawalongele. Habali chinilonda nie mwenyego chilamuligwa chiyatonga munhu imwenga? <verse eid="1CO 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 10:30" />Yahawa noilumba kuja ndia iyo kuno nomwing'ha hewela Mulungu, habali wonilonga kwa ndia ija kwambuli ya kumwing'ha hewela Mulungu?<verse eid="1CO 10:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 10:31" />Baho, chochose chimsang'hana iwe ni kuja hebu kung'wa, sang'haneni gose kwambuli ya kumwing'ha hewela Mulungu.<verse eid="1CO 10:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CO 10:32" />Sekemuwatende Wayahudi hebu kwa Wagiliki sekewamtogole Kilisito. <verse eid="1CO 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CO 10:33" />Muwe kama nie noiyoha kusang'hana kwambuli ya gose gaja ganisang'hana, wanhu wose wawe wodeng'helela. Sio kama nosang'hana ivo kwambuli yangu mwenyego, ila kwambuli ya wanhu wengi wapate kuloholigwa.<verse eid="1CO 10:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="1CO 11" />
  <para style="s">Kugubika ditwi chipindi cha kumfugamila Mulungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 11:1" />Nigeni niye kama vija nie vinimwiga Kilisito.<verse eid="1CO 11:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 11:2" />Baho, noweng'hani nhogolwa kwa vija mazua gose mong'humbuka na kugagoga mahala ganimfundani. <verse eid="1CO 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 11:3" />Mbali ivija nolonda mvimanye kua ditwi da mulume yoyose yomtogola Kilisito ni Kilisito, na Mulume iyo ditwi da mwehe wake, na Mulungu iyo ditwi da Kilisito.<verse eid="1CO 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 11:4" />Baho, chila mulume yofugama hebu yoligula usenga wa Mulungu kuno kagubika ditwi jake, iyo komgela chinyala Kilisito. <verse eid="1CO 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 11:5" />Muke mtogola Kilisito yoyose yofugama hebu yoligula usenga wa Mulungu bila kugubika ditwi jake iyo komgela chinyala mulume wake, yotenda ivo iyo koilinga na ija mwanachike yabeile mvili zake mditwi. <verse eid="1CO 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 11:6" />Kama muke hagubike ditwi jake, iyo kolondeka yabee mvili zake. Mbali kama ni chinyala kwa mwanachike kukanhigwa hebu kubeigwa, baho yofaya yagubike ditwi jake.<verse eid="1CO 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 11:7" />Hailondeka kwa mulume yagubike ditwi jake, kwa vija iyo kailinga na Mulungu na kaidi kolagusa ukulu wa Mulungu. Mbali muke kana ukulu wa mulume, <verse eid="1CO 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 11:8" />kwavija Mulungu hamulumbile mulume kulawa kwa muke, mbali kamulumba muke kulawa kwa mulume. <verse eid="1CO 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 11:9" />Kaidi Mulungu hamlumbile mulume kwambuli ya kumtaza muke, ila kamulumba muke kwambuli ya mulume. <verse eid="1CO 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 11:10" />Kwaivo kwambuli iyo, kaidi kwambuli ya watumigwa wa kwa Mulungu, muke kolondeka yagubike ditwi kulagusa udaho wake. <verse eid="1CO 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 11:11" />Kwambuli ya Mndewa, muke kotumanila mulume, nayo mulume kutumanila muke. <verse eid="1CO 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 11:12" />Kama vija mwanachike viyalawile kwa mulume, ivija mulume koleligwa na mwanachike, baho chila chinhu cholawa kwa Mulungu.<verse eid="1CO 11:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 11:13" />Baho, lamuleni wenyego, ivo yofaya kwa mwanachike kumfugamila Mulungu bila kuigubika mditwi jake? <verse eid="1CO 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 11:14" />Hata ng'huli zenyego yolagusa kua mulume kua na mvili nhali ni chinyala kumwake, <verse eid="1CO 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 11:15" />mbali kwa mwanachike yeli na mvili nhali ni nhogolwa, kwavija keng'higwa mvili nhali kua kama valo da kugubika ditwi. <verse eid="1CO 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 11:16" />Mbali kama hana munhu yonda kubela, cheye chabule mazoela kama gago hata mgamabumbila ga wamtogole Kilisito, ivo ivo vichisang'hana kwa kumfugamila Mulungu.<verse eid="1CO 11:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Malaliko kwa mbuli ya ndia ya Mndewa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 26:26-29">Matayo 26:26-29</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:22-25">Maluko 14:22-25</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:14-20">Luka 22:14-20</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 11:17" />Sambi kwa mbuli ya gago ganilonda kuwalagiza, simtogolani, kwavija haja muhaiting'hanila kumfugamila Mulungu, mosang'hana gaja gowalumizeni ng'hani kubita gaja gowatazeni. <verse eid="1CO 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 11:18" />Nihulika kua haja muhaiting'hanila moihasanya na kuigola. Mgagoga ganihulike gamwenga gakweli. <verse eid="1CO 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 11:19" />Kweli notogola, kutokuitogolela mmwenu kolondeka kulawile, ili waja wamtogola Kilisito waukweli wamanyike. <verse eid="1CO 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 11:20" />Ivo haja mhaiting'hanila, hamja ndia ya Mndewa kama viilondeka, <verse eid="1CO 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 11:21" />Kwavija mwahaja chila munhu koja na kung'wa ndia yake bila kuwabeta wamwenga, ijo dotenda wamwenga waone nzala na wamwenga wakoligwe.<verse eid="1CO 11:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 11:22" />Ivo, hamdaha kuja na kung'wa hakae yenu! Hebu ivo, moizeleu ng'anda ya Mulungu na kuwagela chinyala waja walibule chinhu? Kwa mbuli ino niye nilonge choni kumwenu? Ivo, niweng'he nhogolwa? Hambee! Kwa mbuli ino siweng'ha nhogolwa!<verse eid="1CO 11:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 11:23" />Kwa vija niye nibokela gaja malagizo ganiwalekele kulawa kwa Mndewa, kua chilo chija Mndewa viyahindukigwe, kausola mgate, <verse eid="1CO 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 11:24" />kamwing'ha hewela Mulungu, kaubena kalonga,“Uno uwo lukuli lwangu kwa mbuli yenu, tendeni ivo chila mhaja kwa kung'humbuka niye.”<verse eid="1CO 11:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 11:25" />Ivija, viyamalile kuja, kachisola chikombe cha divai kalonga, “Chino ni chikombe cha lagano da sambi dolagusa kwa damu yangu mbuli iyo ni kweli. Tendeni ivo chila vumng'wa kwa kung'humbuka niye.”<verse eid="1CO 11:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 11:26" />Chila vumja mgate na kuching'wila chikombe chino moilongelela mbaka vonda yeze kua Kilisito kadanganika kwambuli yetu. <verse eid="1CO 11:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 11:27" />Kwaivo, chila youja mgate uwo hebu kung'wila chikombe cha Mndewa vija hailondeka, kokua kasang'hana malozo kwavija kazeleu lukuli na damu ya Mndewa. <verse eid="1CO 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 11:28" />Baho, chila munhu tanhu yailose mmoyo wake mwenyego, amala yauje mgate uwo na kung'wila chikombe icho. <verse eid="1CO 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 11:29" />Mbali kama munhu kong'wa na kuja bila kuvimanya maana ya kuilumba nayo na lukuli lwa Mndewa iyo koja na kung'wa kwa kuilamula mwenyego. <verse eid="1CO 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 11:30" />Iyo mana wengi mmwenu wazidilwa na watamu, kaidi wamwenga wadanganika. <verse eid="1CO 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 11:31" />Mbali tanhu chihailolese goya mmioyo yetu ching'hali hachinakuja, Mulungu yahalekile kuchilamula. <verse eid="1CO 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CO 11:32" />Mbali vichilamuligwa na Mndewa, chofundigwa chitende ganogile, ili seke chilamuligwe hamwe na wanhu wamwenga.<verse eid="1CO 11:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CO 11:33" />Kwaivo mbwiga zangu, muhaiting'hanila kuja ndia ya Mndewa, muibete. <verse eid="1CO 11:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CO 11:34" />Kama hana munhu yoyose yeli na nzala, na yaje ukae yake, ili kuiting'hana kwenu sekekugale kulamuligwa. Mbali kwa mbuli zija zimwenga nokwiza kumweng'heni malagizo vonda nize.<verse eid="1CO 11:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="1CO 12" />
  <para style="s">Nhunza kulawa Muhe wa Mulungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 12:1" />Baho mwiga zangu, kwa mbuli ya nhunza za muhe wa Mulungu nolonda mzimanye goya mbuli zino. <verse eid="1CO 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 12:2" />Movimanya kua, vumkalile mng'hali hamnammanya Mulungu, mukala mlongozigwa na kufugamila milungu ya nyang'iti ilibule ugima.<verse eid="1CO 12:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 12:3" />Baho mvimanye kua, munhu yoyose yolongozigwa na Muhe wa Mulungu hadaha kulonga, “Yesu yenukiligwe! Na ivija munhu yoyose ija halongozigwa na Muhe wa Mulungu hadaha kulonga, “Yesu ni Mndewa,” kama halongozigwe na Muhe wa Mulungu.<verse eid="1CO 12:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 12:4" />Hana nhunza hakwehakwe, mbali yoolava ni Muhe wa Mulungu ni iyoiyo imwe. <verse eid="1CO 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 12:5" />Kaidi hana nzila nyingi za kumsang'hanila Mndewa, mbali Mndewa yosang'haniligwa ni iija imwe. <verse eid="1CO 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 12:6" />Hana nzila hakwehakwe za kusang'hana sang'hano za Mulungu, mbali Mulungu iija imwe yodahiza kusang'hana mbuli zose. <verse eid="1CO 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 12:7" />Chila munhu Muhe wa Mulungu komwing'ha nhunza ya komtaza kusang'hana sang'hano ili chila munhu yawataze wamwenga. <verse eid="1CO 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 12:8" />Muhe wa Mulungu komwing'ha munhu imwe kulonga kwa nzewele, na imwenga kulonga kwa umanyi, nhunza zino zolavigwa na Muhe wa Mulungu iyoiyo kama viyalonda. <verse eid="1CO 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 12:9" />Muhe iyoiyo komwing'ha munhu imwe udaho mkulu wa kumtogola Mulungu, na Muhe iyoiyo komwing'ha imwenga nhunza ya kuhonya. <verse eid="1CO 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 12:10" />Muhe komwing'ha munhu udaho wa kusang'hana mbuli za uzonza, imwenga kulonga Usenga wa Mulungu, imwenga udaho wa kufambula nhunza zija zilawa kwa Muhe wa Mulungu na zija hazilawa kwa Muhe wa Mulungu, komwing'ha imwe udaho wa kulonga ulonzi wa wanhu wamwenga, na imwenga udaho wa kufambula ulonzi uwo. <verse eid="1CO 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 12:11" />Zose izo ni sang'hano za Muhe iija imwe, ija yomwing'ha chila munhu nhunza hakwehakwe kama viyolonda mwenyego.<verse eid="1CO 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lukuli lumwe uli na vilungo vingi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 12:12" />Lukuli una vilungo vingi, mbali vilungo ivo vingi wotenda lukuli umwe, baho kama lukuli vuwili ivo vuwili kwa Kilisito. <verse eid="1CO 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 12:13" />Cheye chahawa Wayahudi, hebu Wayunani, watumwa hebu wanhu hawali watumwa, chose chibatizigwa kwa Muhe iyo umwe mulukuli uwo umwe, na chose ching'higwa Muhe iyo imwe.<verse eid="1CO 12:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 12:14" />Kwavija lukuli hauli chilungo chimwe tu, mbali vilungo vingi. <verse eid="1CO 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 12:15" />Kama mgulu wahailongela, “Kwa vija niye sio mkono, baho niye sio walukuli,” ivo, kwakulonga ivo, iyo yotenda mgulu sio lukuli? <verse eid="1CO 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 12:16" />Najo gutwi dahalonga, “Kwa vija niye sio siso, ivo,kwa kulonga ivo, iyo kulonga sio lukuli,” ? <verse eid="1CO 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 12:17" />Kama lukuli wose wahawa siso, ihawilize kuhulika? Na kama lukuli wose wahawile gutwi, ihawileze kunusa? <verse eid="1CO 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 12:18" />Mbali kama viili, Mulungu kavika vilungo hakwehakwe valukuli kama viyalondile. <verse eid="1CO 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 12:19" />Kama vilungo vose vahawile chilungo chimwe, lukuli wahawile kulihi! <verse eid="1CO 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 12:20" />Ukweli uo uno vilungo ni vingi ila lukuli lumwe.<verse eid="1CO 12:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 12:21" />Kwaivo, siso hadidaha kuulongela mkono, “Gweye uko sikulonda,” hebu ditwi hadidaha kugalongela magulu, “Mweye uko siwalonda!” <verse eid="1CO 12:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 12:22" />Ila vilungo vioneka havidaha kutaza ivo vilondeka ng'hani, <verse eid="1CO 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 12:23" />kaidi vija vilungo va lukuli vioneka ni vakuzeleuligwa ivo choving'ha nhogolwa, navo vilungo vetu va lukuli vija vooneka vogala chilanya, ivo chovika goya ng'hani, <verse eid="1CO 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 12:24" />vilungo vetu vili na nhogolwa havilonda kwin‘igwa goya kama vimwenga. Mbali Mulungu mwenyego kawika goya vilungo va lukuli, vilungo vija vozeleuligwa koving'ha nhogolwa. <verse eid="1CO 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 12:25" />Ili sekekulawile kuibagula muulukuli, mbali vilungo vose vitende sang'hano hamwe. <verse eid="1CO 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 12:26" />Kama chilungo chimwe chhalumila, vose volumila hamwe na icho. Kaidi chilungo chimwe chiheng' higwa nhogolwa, vose vodeng' helela hamwe na icho.<verse eid="1CO 12:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 12:27" />Baho, mweye wose ni lukuli lwa Kilisito, chila munhu ni chilungo cha uwo lukuli. <verse eid="1CO 12:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 12:28" />Mdibumbila da wamtogole Kilisito, Mulungu keka chila chinhu goya, mosi wasenga wa Mulungu, kaidi waligulaji Usenga wa Mulungu, amala keka wafundaji, hamwande keka waja wosang'hana uzonza, weli na nhunza ya kuhonya watamu, weli na nhunza ya kuwataza wamwenga, weli na nhunza ya kulongoza na weli na nhunza ya kulonga ulonzi wa wamwenga. <verse eid="1CO 12:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 12:29" />Ivo, wanhu wose ni wasenga wa Mulungu? Hebu wose ni waligulaji wa usenga wa Mulungu? Hebu wose ni wafundaji? Hebu wose ni weli na nhunza ya kusang'hana uzonza? <verse eid="1CO 12:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 12:30" />Hebu wose wana nhunza ya kuhonya? Hebu kulonga ulonzi wa wamwenga? Hebu kufambula ulonzi? <verse eid="1CO 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 12:31" />Baho muiyohe kulonda nhunza ng'hulu. Kaidi nolonda kuwalongela vija viifaya kusang'hana vinogile ng'hani.<verse eid="1CO 12:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="1CO 13" />
  <para style="s">Wende uwalongoze</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 13:1" />Hata kama nihalonga ulonzi wa wanhu na hata za Watumigwa wa kwa Mulungu, mbali kama nabule wende niye ng'hala tu kama dizi da bati. <verse eid="1CO 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 13:2" />Kaidi hata nihawa na udaho wa kuligula Usenga wa Mulungu, na kuzimanya mbuli zose za Mulungu sifisigwe na kuchimanya chila chinhu umanyi wose na, hata nihawa nodaha kumtogola Mulungu ng'hani hata kuhamiza vigogo, mbali kamanabule wende niye si chinhu. <verse eid="1CO 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 13:3" />Nihalava chila chinhu nilinacho na kuweng'ha vikumbi muyega na kaidi nihaulava lukuli lwangu lose usomigwe moto, kama nabule wende hainifaya chinhu.<verse eid="1CO 13:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 13:4" />Yeli na wende hufunya moyo, kana nying'ha, yeli na wende kabule maya, haigoda hebu kabule udulu hebu, <verse eid="1CO 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 13:5" />yeli na wende hahungukigwa na utegelezi, yeli na wende haiongezela mbuli zake mwenyego, yeli na wende kabule ng'hasiliki, yeli na wende hapeta gehile, <verse eid="1CO 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 13:6" />munhu yeli na wende haudeng'helela ubananzi, mbali hudeng'helela kweli. <verse eid="1CO 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 13:7" />Yeli na wende hufunya moyo kwa gose na huwagatogola wamwenga na hufunya moyo kwa tumanilo.<verse eid="1CO 13:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 13:8" />Wende haumala mbe. Mbali nhunza zimwenga zina uhelelo wake, kama kuligula Usenga wa Mulungu, na kulonga ulonzi wa wamwenga na kua na umanyi umwenga. <verse eid="1CO 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 13:9" />Kwavija chogamanya madodo, kaidi usenga wa Mulungu choulonga chidodo uja chiumanyile tu,<verse eid="1CO 13:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 13:10" />mmazua gokwiza chozimanya mbuli zino kama vizili, na mbuli zija zichimanya chodogo zokwiza kumala.<verse eid="1CO 13:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 13:11" />Vinikalile ching'hele nilonga kama ching'hele, nigesa kama ching'hele, nitonga kama ching'hele, mbali sambi niye na mkulu mbuli za udodo nizileka. <verse eid="1CO 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 13:12" />Chiniona sambi noona kama chivulivuli cha chihanga, mbali chipindi chokwiza hachikitumanila kilole. Chokwiza kuchiona chila chinhu hazelu. Sambi chovimanya hanhu hadodo tu muikweli ya Mulungu. Mbali baho hamwande chokwiza kuvimanya vose vija viili kama vija Mulungu viyochimanya cheye kwa chila chinhu.<verse eid="1CO 13:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 13:13" />Ivo baho, gosigala gano madatu, kumtogola Mulungu, tamanilo da kubokela vinhu kulawa kwa Mulungu na wende, mbali dilikulu mwa gano madatu ni wende.<verse eid="1CO 13:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="1CO 14" />
  <para style="s">Nhunza zimwenga za Muhe wa Mulungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 14:1" />Iyoheni kua na wende. Ivija iyoheni kubokela nhunza zimwenga za Muhe Mulungu, na muilonde ng'hani nhunza ya kuligula usenga wa Mulungu. <verse eid="1CO 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 14:2" />Ija yolonga ulonzi wa wamwenga, halonga na wanhu mbali kolonga na Mulungu. Iyo kolonga na Mulungu kwavija habule munhu yochimanya chiolonga. <verse eid="1CO 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 14:3" />Mbali ija yeli na nhunza ya kuligula usenga wa Mulungu, iyo kolonga na wanhu kwa mbuli ya kuwatenda wanhu wagangamale kwa kumtogola Kilisito, koweng'ha deng'o na kuwagela moyo. <verse eid="1CO 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 14:4" />Iyo yolonga kwa ulonzi yeng'higwe na Muhe wa Mulungu koitaza mwenyego, mbali yeli na nhunza ya kuligula usenga wa Mulungu, kowataza wamtogole Kilisito.<verse eid="1CO 14:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 14:5" />Baho, nilonda mweye mose mlonge kwa ulonzi wa mwing'higwe na Muhe wa Mulungu, mbali niwalonda ng'hani muwe na nhuza ya kuligula usenga wa Mulungu, kwa vija muhnu yeli na nhunza ya kuligula usenga wa Mulungu iyo kofaya ng'hani kubita iyo yolonga ulonzi mwing'higwe na Mulungu, mbali tu kama baho hana munhu wa kufambula mbuli izo zilongigwa ili wanhu wamtogole Kilisito wazimanye mbuli izo. <verse eid="1CO 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 14:6" />Ivo mweye mbwiga zangu, kama naheza kumwenu na kulonga ulonzi mwing'higwe na Muhe wa Mulungu yomtazeni choni? Hambee haiwafaya chochose, mbali nihawalongeleni gaja Mulungu gayanilongele kwambuli ya umanyi wowose hebu usenga wa Mulungu hebu ufundaji umwenga.<verse eid="1CO 14:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 14:7" />Ivoili hata kwa vinhu vilibule ugima vija volava dizi kama vija, filimbi hebu chinanda. Ivo, munhu kodahaze kuumanya wila utoigwa kama vinhu ivo vitoigwa havilava dizi kwa nzila ija ilondeka? <verse eid="1CO 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 14:8" />Kaidi, kama talumbeta da bung'hukila haditoigwa kwa dizi dilondeka, yelihi yonda yaitande goya kwa mbuli ya bung'hukila? <verse eid="1CO 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 14:9" />Ivoili, na mweye mwahalonga mbuli hazimanyika, yelihi yonda yavimanye vumlonga? Mbuli zenu zokua za chakachaka tu. <verse eid="1CO 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 14:10" />Muuisi hana ulonzi hakwehakwe, na habule hata imwe ilibule maana. <verse eid="1CO 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 14:11" />Mbali kama niye simanya chilongigwa na muhnu imwenga, niye nokua nohulika dizi sidimanyile nayo kokua kohulika dizi hadimanyile kumwangu. <verse eid="1CO 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 14:12" />Namweye ivija, kwavija molonda kubokela nhunza za Muhe wa Mulungu, iyoheni kubokela vija vitaza kuwagela moyo wamtogole Kilisito.<verse eid="1CO 14:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 14:13" />Kwaivo, iyo yolonga ulonzi mwing'higwe na Muhe wa Mulungu yapule yabokele udahi wa kufambula chija chiyalonga. <verse eid="1CO 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 14:14" />Nihapula kwa ulonzi mwing'higwe na Muhe wa Mulungu, muhe wangu uwo wopula, mbali nzewele zangu hazimanya chinhu. <verse eid="1CO 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 14:15" />Ivo nhendeze baho? Nokwiza kupula kwa muhe wangu, mbali ivija nokwiza kupula kwa nzewele zangu, nokwiza kwimba kwa muhe wangu, na nokwiza kwimba ivija kwa umanyi wangu. <verse eid="1CO 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 14:16" />Mbali wahamwing'ha nhogolwa Mulungu kwa muhe wako tu, mlihamwe kumfugamila Mulungu kodahaze kwidikila kumtogola kwako Mulungu kwa kulonga,”Pepa,” kama hachimanya chuulonga? <verse eid="1CO 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 14:17" />Kupula kwako kwa kumwing'ha hewela Mulungu kodahika kua kweli kofaya, mbali kwa iyo munhu imwenga haimfaya chinhu.<verse eid="1CO 14:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 14:18" />Nomwing'ha hewela Mulungu kwavija niye nolonga ulonzi mwing'higwe na Muhe wa Mulungu kubita mweye mose. <verse eid="1CO 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 14:19" />Mbali mui mating'hanilo ga wamtogole Kilisito, nolonda ng'hani kulonga mbuli tano zimanyika ili kuwafunda wamwenga kubita kulonga mbuli elufu mwing'higwe na Muhe wa Mulungu.<verse eid="1CO 14:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 14:20" />Mbwiga zangu, sekemuwe kama wana wadodo mzi nhonga zenu, kwa mbuli ya ubananzi, mkali kama ving'hele, mbali mzinhonga zenu molondeka mkale kama wanhu mkangale kumtola Mulungu. <verse eid="1CO 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 14:21" />Yandikigwa mMulungu Musa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CO 14:21">“Kubitila waja wolonga ulonzi mwing'higwe na Muhe wa Mulungu, Mndewa kolonga, ‘Nolonga na wanhu wanhu. Nolonga kubitila milomo ya nyambenyambe, hata ivo wanhu wangu hondanitegeleze.”<verse eid="1CO 14:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 14:22" />Ivo baho, nhunza ya kulonga ulonzi mwing'higwe na Muhe wa Mulungu ni chilaguso, sio kwa wanhu wamtogola Kilisito, mbali kwa mbuli ya waja hawamtogole Kilisito, mbali nhunza ya kuligula usenga wa Mulungu ni kwa mbuli ya waja wamtogole Kilisito mbali sio kwa waja hawamtogole Kilisito.<verse eid="1CO 14:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 14:23" />Baho, wamtogole Kilisito wahaiting'hanila hamwe na wose wahasonga kulonga ulongi mwing'higwe na Muhe wa Mulungu, na waheza wanhu waja hawatogole hebu waja hawamtogole Kilisito, ivo, haweza kulonga mweye mna vichala? <verse eid="1CO 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 14:24" />Mbali wose wahauligula usenga wa Mulungu, yaheza munhu miangu na nie hebu hamtogole Kilisito, gose gonda yahulike golagusa mbuli zake zihile. Gose gonda yahulika gomlamula mwenyego, <verse eid="1CO 14:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 14:25" />Mbuli zake zifisigwe mmoyo wake zofisuligwa, nayo kotumbala mavindi na kumfugamila Mulungu yolonga, “Kweli Mulungu kahamwe na mweye.”<verse eid="1CO 14:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kumpula Mulungukama viilondeka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 14:26" />Ndugu chilonge choni baho? vuumuiting'hanila hamwe kumfugamila Mulungu, imwe yembe wila, imwenga yawafunde, imwenga yawe na ugubulo kulawa kwa Mulungu, imwenga yatumile nhunza ya kulonga ulonzi mwing'higwe na Muhe wa Mulungu na imwenga yafambule golongiwa. Gose gawe kwa mbuli ya kuwagela moyo wamtogole Kilisito. <verse eid="1CO 14:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 14:27" />Wahawa baho wanhu weli na nhunza za kulonga ulonzi mwing'higwe na Muhe wa Mulungu walonge wanhu waidi waidi hebu wadatu, sio kubitiliza, kaidi yalonge imwe imwe, yawe baho munhu wa kufambula golongigwa. <verse eid="1CO 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 14:28" />Mbali kama habule munhu wa kufambula, baho munhu yoyose yolonga ulonzi mwing'higwe na Muhe wa Mulungu yanyamle hupi, yalonge na muhe wake mwenyego na Mulungu.<verse eid="1CO 14:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 14:29" />Na waja weli na nhunza ya kuligula usenga wa Mulungu, walonge wanhu waidi hebu wadatu, na wamwenga wawataze goya zija ziwalonga. <verse eid="1CO 14:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 14:30" />Yahawa munhu yahagendelela kulonga na imwenga mwa waja wotegelezaji kabokela ugubulo kulawa kwa Mulungu, baho iyo yolonga yanyamale. <verse eid="1CO 14:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 14:31" />Kwavija mose modaha kuligula usenga wa Mulungu, imwe imwe, ili mose mfundigwe na kugeligwa moyo. <verse eid="1CO 14:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CO 14:32" />Nhunza ya kuligula usenga wa Mulungu cholondeka chilongozigwe na iyo yeli na nhunza, <verse eid="1CO 14:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CO 14:33" />kwavija Mulungu si Mulungu wa ndwagi ila wa utindiwala.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CO 14:33">Kama viili mwa wamtogole Kilisito wose Mzing'anda za Mulungu, <verse eid="1CO 14:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CO 14:34" />wanachike wolondeka wanyamale hupi mmiting'hanilo. Hawalondeka kulonga mbuli, kama ndagizi za Wayahudi vizilonga, hawalondeka kulongoza <verse eid="1CO 14:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1CO 14:35" />Wahawa wana mbuli za kuuza, wawauze walume zao uko ukae, kwavija ni chinyala kwa mwanachike kulonga mumting'hanilo wa wamtogole Kilisito.<verse eid="1CO 14:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="1CO 14:36" />Ivo mogesa kua usenga wa Mulungu ulawa kumwenu mweye hebu uwezila mweye muiyeka? <verse eid="1CO 14:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1CO 14:37" />Kama munhu yoyose kotonga kua iyo ni msenga wa Mulungu hebu kana nhunza ya Muhe wa Mulungu, na yavimanye kua gano ganiwandikileni mweye iyo ndagizi ya Mndewa. <verse eid="1CO 14:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1CO 14:38" />Mbali munhu hogamanya gago, baho munhu seke mgese munhu iyo.<verse eid="1CO 14:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="1CO 14:39" />Ivo baho, mbwiga zangu molondeka kua na ng'ilu ya kuligula usenga wa Mulungu, mbali sekemumgome munhu kulongola kwa ulonzi mwing'higwe na Muhe wa Mulungu. <verse eid="1CO 14:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1CO 14:40" />Ivo gose gatendeke vija viilondeka kwa kuwataza wanhu.<verse eid="1CO 14:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="1CO 15" />
  <para style="s">Kuzilibuka kwa Kilisito</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 15:1" />Mbwiga zangu nolonda sekemuisemwe usenga uja niwaligulile, muubokela usenga uwo na gendeleleni kuuwinza. <verse eid="1CO 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 15:2" />Usenga Unogile uwo ni usenga muuhulike kulawa kumwangu, ni nzila ya Mulungu ya kuwalohola. Molondeka mgendelele kutogola, yahawa muuleka baho kutogola kwenu si chinhu.<verse eid="1CO 15:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 15:3" />Niye niweng'heni mweye mbuli zinogile ng'hani zija zinibokele, kua Kilisito kadanganika kwa malozo getu kuilinga na Mayandiko ga Mulungu, <verse eid="1CO 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 15:4" />kua kawandigwa na kazilibuligwa mdizua da kadatu kama Mayandiko vigandikigwe, <verse eid="1CO 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 15:5" />kua kamlawila Kefa na hamwande kawalawila waja kumi na waidi. <verse eid="1CO 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 15:6" />Amala kawalawila mbwiga wobita mia tano kwa mala lumwe, wengi wao wang'hali na ugima, mbali wamwenga wao wamala kudanganika. <verse eid="1CO 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 15:7" />Hamwande kamlawila Yakobo amala kawalawila wasenga wose.<verse eid="1CO 15:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 15:8" />Viyakomeleze kuwalawila wose kanilawila na niye, niye nikala kama munhu nileligwe mchipindi si changu. <verse eid="1CO 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 15:9" />Niye na mdodo kabisa mwa wao wasenga, na ivija silondeka kukemigwa msenga, kwa vija niwadununza bumbila da wamtogole Kilisito. <verse eid="1CO 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 15:10" />Mbali kwa unovu wa Mulungu, nikala kama vinili, kwa unovu wake kumwangu haubitile bule. Niye nisang'hana sang'hano kubita wose, si niye mbe mbali uja unovu wa Mulungu usang'hane mgati yangu. <verse eid="1CO 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 15:11" />Mbali hata ivo, yahawa wao iyo woligula hebu niye iyo niligula, chose chiligula usenga uwo unogile, na uwo uwo usenga muutogole.<verse eid="1CO 15:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuzilibuka kwetu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 15:12" />Cholongiligwa kua Kilisito kazilibuligwa. Ivo habali wamwenga wenu molonga wanhu wafile hawazilibuligwa? <verse eid="1CO 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 15:13" />Mbali kama yahawa habule uzilibuko, baho hata Kilisito hazilibuke, <verse eid="1CO 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 15:14" />kaidi kama Kilisito hazilibuke, baho kuligula kwetu si chinhu na kutogola kwetu kwabule chinhu. <verse eid="1CO 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 15:15" />Ivo kwa gago gose, baho chooneka kua chovwiza vichilonga mbuli ya Mulungu, kwavija chiligula kua Mulungu kamzilibula Kilisito kumbe hamzilibule, mbali ijo hadidahika kua kweli kama wafile hawazilibuligwa. <verse eid="1CO 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 15:16" />Kwaivo yahawa wafile hawazilibuligwa, baho hata Kilisito nayo hazilibuke. <verse eid="1CO 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 15:17" />Kaidi yahawa Kilisito hanazilibuligwa, kutogola kwenu kwabule chinhu, na mweye mng'hali mokala mgamalozo genu. <verse eid="1CO 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 15:18" />Kubita gago gose na waja wose wadanganike wahawa wailumba na Kilisito waga tu. <verse eid="1CO 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 15:19" />Yahawa tumanilo jetu mgati mwa Kilisito ni kwa mbuli ya ugima uno tu muuisi, cheye cholondeka kuoneligwa bazi kubita wanhu wamwenga wose muiisi.<verse eid="1CO 15:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 15:20" />Mbali kweli Kilisito kazilibuligwa, iyo wa mosi mwa waja wose wonda kuzilibuligwa. <verse eid="1CO 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 15:21" />Kwavija ifa igaligwa muiisi kwa nzila ya munhu imwe iyo Adamu, ivija kuzilibuka kwa wanhu kugaligwa kwa nzila ya munhu imwenga iyo Kilisito. <verse eid="1CO 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 15:22" />Baho kuilumba na Adamu wanhu wose wodanganika, ivija kuilumba na Kilisito wanhu wose wokwing'higwa ugima. <verse eid="1CO 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 15:23" />Mbali chila munhu kozilibuligwa kwa chipindi chake, Kilisito wa mosi, amala waja weli wake Kilisito wokwiza kuzilibuligwa na Kilisito vonda yeze.<verse eid="1CO 15:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 15:24" />Gahamala gago chikomelezo chovika, Kilisito vonda yawabanange walongozi wa isi na wakulu wa isi na weli na ludabwa, amala komwing'ha Mulungu Tata ufaume. <verse eid="1CO 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 15:25" />Kilisito kolondeka yalongoze mbaka Kilisito vonda yawahume wahasanyi wake wose na kuwalongoza. <verse eid="1CO 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 15:26" />Muhasanyi wa chikomelezo yondayabanangigwe ni ifa. <verse eid="1CO 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 15:27" />Kama Mayandiko vigandikigwe, “Mulungu keka vinhu vose muulongozi wake.” Ni kweli kua chihalonga vinhu vose sio va Mulungu mwenyego, ija yavikile vinhu vose muulongozi wa Kilisito. <verse eid="1CO 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 15:28" />Mbali vinhu vose vonda vikigwe muulongozi wa Kilisito, ivo nayo Mwana vonda yavike muulongozi wa Mulungu, yekile vose haulongozi wake ili Mulungu yalongoze vose.<verse eid="1CO 15:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 15:29" />Kama habule uzilibuko, ivo waja wanhu wobatizigwa kwa mbuli ya wafile wotumanila kupata choni? Kama wafile hawazilibuligwa, habali wobatizigwa kwa mbuli yao? <verse eid="1CO 15:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 15:30" />Na cheye habali chonda chingile muibung'hukila chila saa? <verse eid="1CO 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 15:31" />Mbwiga zangu, niye nokimbilila ifa chila zua! Chiniigodela ng'hani kumwenu ni kuilumba na Kilisito Yesu Mndewa wetu yonitenda niilonge mbuli ino.<verse eid="1CO 15:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CO 15:32" />Kama tamanilo jangu dahawile da kimunhu munhu tu, viniitoile na wanhu kuja Efeso, kama kuwakoma “Wanyama wakali“ hano Efeso nahapatile chinhu gani kwa mbuli iyo? Kama wafile hawazilibuligwa, baho, “Chije na kung'wa, kwavija igolo chodanganika.”<verse eid="1CO 15:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CO 15:33" />Sekemuivwizile! “Wahailumba na mbwinga wehile wobananga nhogolwa yako.” <verse eid="1CO 15:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CO 15:34" />Lamkeni! songeni kukala vinogile, na lekeni kutenda malozo. Wamwenga wenu hamummanya kabisa Mulungu. Nowalongeleni kweli chino chinyala chikulu kumwenu.<verse eid="1CO 15:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lukuli lwa Uzilibuko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="1CO 15:35" />Mbali munhu kodaha kuuza, “Wafile wozilibuligwa vilihi? Wokua na lukuli lwavilihi?” <verse eid="1CO 15:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1CO 15:36" />Mweye motonga ubozi! Wahahanda mbeyu, kama haifile haidaha kota. <verse eid="1CO 15:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1CO 15:37" />Na chuuhanda ni mbeyu iiyeka, iwe ya ngano hebu mbeyu imwenga, na sio mbiki uja wolawila hamwande. <verse eid="1CO 15:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1CO 15:38" />Mulungu koing'ha iyo mbeyu lumbo diyolonda mwenyego, chila mbeyu yopata lumbo jake diiyeka.<verse eid="1CO 15:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="1CO 15:39" />Kwavija ng'huli za vilumbe vose haziilinga. Ng'uli za wanhu zoilinga, na wanyama woilinga vimwenga, ya ndege woilinga vimwenga, na somba ivija woilinga vimwenga.<verse eid="1CO 15:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="1CO 15:40" />Ivo hana ng'huli za kuulanga kwa Mulungu na ng'huli za muuisi, unovu wa ng'huli za kuulanga kwa Mulungu una vija vuuli na unovu wa ng'huli za muuisi una vija vuuli. <verse eid="1CO 15:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="1CO 15:41" />Zua dina unovu wake, na mwezi una vija vuuli, na nhondo zina unovu umwenga. Kwaivo nhondo haziilinga kwa unovu wake.<verse eid="1CO 15:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="1CO 15:42" />Ivo ili kwa mbuli ya uzilibuko. Kama vija mbeyu, lukuli wohandigwa muulongo kuno ubanangika, mbali wozilibuligwa uli na ugima uja haubanangika. <verse eid="1CO 15:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="1CO 15:43" />Lukuli wozeleuligwa uhawandigwa, mbali uhazilibuligwa wokua na ukulu. Lukuli wokuwa wabule ludabwa na haunogile uhawandigwa, mbali wahazilibuligwa wokua na ludabwa mkulu. <verse eid="1CO 15:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="1CO 15:44" />Uhawawandigwa ni lukuli yeka, uhazilibuligwa ni lukuli lwa muhe. Hana lukuli yeka na hokua na lukuli lwa muhe.<verse eid="1CO 15:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="1CO 15:45" />Kwaivo Mayandiko gandikigwa, “Munhu wa mosi, Adamu kakala chilumbe yeli na ugima,” mbali Adamu wachikomelezo ni Muhe wa Mulungu yoweng'ha wanhu ugima. <verse eid="1CO 15:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="1CO 15:46" />Mbali uja ulongole kulawila sio uja lukuli lwa muhe, mbali uja lukuli yeka, amala uja lukuli lwa muhe vondawize. <verse eid="1CO 15:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="1CO 15:47" />Munhu wa mosi Adamu kalumbigwa kwa ulongo, kalawa muiisi, na Munhu wa kaidi kalawa kuulanga kwa Mulungu. <verse eid="1CO 15:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="1CO 15:48" />Wose weli muiisi wako kama iyo munhu yalumbigwe kwa ulongo, waja weli kuulanga kwa Mulungu wako kama ija Munhu yaliawile kuulanga kwa Mulungu. <verse eid="1CO 15:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="1CO 15:49" />Kama vija vichiigalile na iyo munhu yalumbigwe kwa ulongo, ivija choigala na iyo yalawie Kuulanga kwa Mulungu.<verse eid="1CO 15:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="1CO 15:50" />Baho mbwiga zangu niye nolonga vino, chija chisang'hanigwe kwa lukuli na damu hachidahika kupata nyafasi muufaume wa Mulungu, na chija hachibanangika hachidaha kua kama chija chibanangika.<verse eid="1CO 15:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="1CO 15:51" />Mweye tegelezeni niwalongele mbuli ija Mulungu hanawalongela wanhu. Cheye hachidanganika chose, mbali chose chohinduligwa,<verse eid="1CO 15:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="1CO 15:52" />mchipindi cha mhalati ya chikomelezo ihalila, bahaja uhafing'iliza na kulola. Kwavija mhalati ya chikomelezo yahalila, wafile wozilibuligwa mzing'huli zija hazidaha kudanganika kaidi, na cheye chohinduligwa na chogeluka kua na ng'huli uja haufa. <verse eid="1CO 15:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="1CO 15:53" />Kwavija yolondeka chila chija chibanangika cholondeka chivale lukuli uja haubanangika, na lukuli udaha kudanganika uvalile lukuli uja haudanganika. <verse eid="1CO 15:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="1CO 15:54" />Baho lukuli uno wakubanangika vonda uvale lukuli uja haubanangika, na chija chidanganika chihava lukuli uja haudanganika baho hondadivikile dija yandiko jandikigwe, “Ifa ibanangigwa na uhumi upatika!”<verse eid="1CO 15:54" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="1CO 15:55" />“Ifa, wakulihi uhumi wako? na udaho wako wa kulumiza wakulihi?”<verse eid="1CO 15:55" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" sid="1CO 15:56" />Ifa yopata udaho wa kuchilumiza kulawa mmalozo, na malozo gopata udaho wa kulumiza kulawa mzindazi. <verse eid="1CO 15:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="1CO 15:57" />Mbali chomwing'ha hewela Mulungu kwa kuching'ha uhumi kubitila nzila ya Mndewa wetu Yesu Kilisito!<verse eid="1CO 15:57" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="1CO 15:58" />Baho mbwiga zangu wa wende, kaleni kwa kugangamala kumtogola Kilisito, sekemhinduke. Gendeleleni kugangamala mazua gose kuiyoha muisang'hano ya Mndewa, kuno movimanya kua sang'hano muisang'hana muisang'hano ya Mndewa hayaga bule.<verse eid="1CO 15:58" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="1CO 16" />
  <para style="s">Nhosa ya kuwataza wamtogole Kilisito</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 16:1" />Sambi uja msango wa sente kwa mbuli ya wanhu wamtogole Kilisito uko Yudea. Tendeni kama viwanilagize kwa wamtogole Kilisito weli uko Galatia. <verse eid="1CO 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 16:2" />Mdizua da jumapili, chila munhu mmwenu yabagule chiasi cha sente kulawa mzisente zake, ili kusanga chija chiyodaha kuilinga na ganogile ga Mulungu gayabokele. Naivo hamlondeka kukunzanya hajavonda nize.<verse eid="1CO 16:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 16:3" />Kwaivo vondanize kumwenu, nokwiza kuwatuma waja muwasagule kulawa mmwenu wagale balua na magweko genu uko Yelusalemu. <verse eid="1CO 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 16:4" />Kama yofaya na niye niite, baho woita hamwe na niye.<verse eid="1CO 16:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paulo kolonda kuita kaidi uko Kolinto</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 16:5" />Nokwiza kumwenu kwa kubitila Makedonia, kwavija notumanila kubitila uko makedonia. <verse eid="1CO 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 16:6" />Viioneka nokala kumwenu chipindi chiguhi, hebu nodaha kukala na mweye chipindi chose cha mbeho, ili mpate kunisangila sente nigendelele na mwanza wangu wa hohose haniita.<verse eid="1CO 16:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 16:7" />Niye silonda kubita kumwenu himahima na kugendelela na mwanza, notamanila kukala kumwenu kwa chipindi chitali kama Mndewa viyalonda.<verse eid="1CO 16:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 16:8" />Mbali nokala hano Efeso mbaka zua da Pentekoste. <verse eid="1CO 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 16:9" />Mulungu kaning'ha nyafasi ya kusang'hana sang'hano ng'hulu hano, mbali hana wanhu wengi wonilema.<verse eid="1CO 16:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 16:10" />Kama Timoteo yaheza kumwenu, mbokeleni vinogile, ivija loleni sekeyadumbe chochose haja yahawa na mweye, kwa vija kosang'hana sang'hano da Mndewa kama niye. <verse eid="1CO 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 16:11" />Kwaivo munhu yoyose sekeyamzeleu ila mtazeni ili yagendelele na mwanza wake kwa utindiwala ili yadahe kubwela kumwangu, kwavija niye nombeta hamwe na mbwiga zenu.<verse eid="1CO 16:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 16:12" />Baho kwa mbuli ya ndugu yetu Apolo, nimpula ng'hani yeze kumwenu hamwe na wanhu wamwenga, mbali halonda kabisa kwiza sambi. Ivo yahapata nyafasi kokwiza.<verse eid="1CO 16:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paulo kokomeleza balua yake</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 16:13" />Kaleni meso, mwime goya kwa kumtogola Kilisito, muwe magalu na mli na ludabwa. <verse eid="1CO 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 16:14" />Sang'haneni chila chinhu kwa wende kwa wamwenga.<verse eid="1CO 16:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 16:15" />Mweye mbwiga zangu, movimanya kua walukolo wa Sitefana, wao wakala wanhu wa mosi kumtogola Kilisito muikae ya Akaya, na ivija wailava kuwasang'hanila wanhu wa Mulungu. Niye nompulani mweye mbwiga zangu, <verse eid="1CO 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 16:16" />Molondeka kuwategeleza wanhu kama wao, ivija muwategeleze wanhu wose wasang'hana sang'hano ya Mulungu hamwe na wao.<verse eid="1CO 16:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 16:17" />Nodeng'helela ng'hani kwa vija Setefana na Fotunata na Akaiko wavika, wano wanipatila chija chinihungukiligwe haja mweye hamkalile hano, <verse eid="1CO 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 16:18" />na waning'ha deng'o niye na mweye mwing'higwa ivija. Kwaivo yolondeka kuleka kuwasemwa wanhu kama wano.<verse eid="1CO 16:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 16:19" />Mabumbila ga wanhu wamtogole Kilisito wose weli uko Asia wowalamuseni, Akula na Pilisila hamwe na wanhu wose wa wamtogole Kilisito weli mzikae zao wowalamuseni ng'hani mwahailumba na Mndewa.<verse eid="1CO 16:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 16:20" />Wanhu wose womtogola Kilisito weli hano wowalamuseni. Na mweye muilamuse kwa wende mlaguse kua mna utindiwala.<verse eid="1CO 16:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 16:21" />Niye Paulo nowalamuseni, kuno nokwandika kwa mkono wangu mwenyego.<verse eid="1CO 16:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 16:22" />Munhu yoyose ija hamwing'ha wende Mndewa, na yenukiligwe! MALANATA-Mndewa izo!<verse eid="1CO 16:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 16:23" />Nompula Mndewa wetu Yesu yagendelele kuweng'ha ganogile gake.<verse eid="1CO 16:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 16:24" />Wende wangu ukale kumwenu muhailumba na Yesu Kilisito.<verse eid="1CO 16:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 16" />
</usx>